(312569, 23384, 8522, '<td valign="top">Could do with more movement. The hands look like those of a pianist... but not a good model, that little finger fingernail is bitten! Nice and sharp, good dof. 6</td>', 'Could do with more movement. The hands look like those of a pianist... but not a good model, that little finger fingernail is bitten! Nice and sharp, good dof. 6', '2003-06-02 09:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(312571, 23314, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, works very nicely in black and white. I like the graininess. The alarm works well because you can see it half defined in the two places where it strikes the bells. Good lighting. 10</td>', 'Beautiful picture, works very nicely in black and white. I like the graininess. The alarm works well because you can see it half defined in the two places where it strikes the bells. Good lighting. 10', '2003-06-02 09:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(312573, 23496, 8522, '<td valign="top">Mesmerising picture. Perfect exposure length. I can certainly hear the sound of the water. 10</td>', 'Mesmerising picture. Perfect exposure length. I can certainly hear the sound of the water. 10', '2003-06-02 09:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(312576, 23517, 8522, '<td valign="top">Amazing lighting... I''d love to know your setup.  Very nice blues and oranges. I love the way you have captured the textures. Great stock photo. 10</td>', 'Amazing lighting... I''d love to know your setup.  Very nice blues and oranges. I love the way you have captured the textures. Great stock photo. 10', '2003-06-02 09:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(312577, 23370, 8522, '<td valign="top">Shame you couldn''t desaturate the yellow around the person... other than that I love this picture. Great compostition, I like the blown out highlights on the trumpet. I would perhaps have tinkered with the hue a little in photoshop... can''t quite put my finger on it. 9</td>', 'Shame you couldn''t desaturate the yellow around the person... other than that I love this picture. Great compostition, I like the blown out highlights on the trumpet. I would perhaps have tinkered with the hue a little in photoshop... can''t quite put my finger on it. 9', '2003-06-02 09:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(312579, 22947, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wondeful macro. Superb composition, great textures and shapes. Nice lighting. I like the blur caused by the exposure length, The dof is spot on. 10<br/>BTW, is the spelling a strange play on words?!</td>', 'Wondeful macro. Superb composition, great textures and shapes. Nice lighting. I like the blur caused by the exposure length, The dof is spot on. 10BTW, is the spelling a strange play on words?!', '2003-06-02 10:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(312580, 23425, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, interesting expression. Nice portrait. 9</td>', 'Great lighting, interesting expression. Nice portrait. 9', '2003-06-02 10:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(312586, 23379, 8488, '<td valign="top">10 for concept,  8 for execution: 9 overall. :-&gt; A little more drama in the contrast/lighting might well have pumped it a bit higher, but still, very good. I hear the photo (which is my major grading criteria for this contest), and  it''s an appealing image overall. I like the tight crop. The composition''s a little muddy, but it''s still good.</td>', '10 for concept,  8 for execution: 9 overall. :-> A little more drama in the contrast/lighting might well have pumped it a bit higher, but still, very good. I hear the photo (which is my major grading criteria for this contest), and  it''s an appealing image overall. I like the tight crop. The composition''s a little muddy, but it''s still good.', '2003-06-02 10:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(312589, 23370, 8488, '<td valign="top">10 for concept,  10 for execution: 10 overall. :-&gt; Dramatic; I love the silhouette in the back. Just the trumpet wouldn''t be nearly as strong.. I hear the photo (which is my major grading criteria for this contest), and  it''s an appealing image overall.</td>', '10 for concept,  10 for execution: 10 overall. :-> Dramatic; I love the silhouette in the back. Just the trumpet wouldn''t be nearly as strong.. I hear the photo (which is my major grading criteria for this contest), and  it''s an appealing image overall.', '2003-06-02 10:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(312591, 23529, 8488, '<td valign="top">10 for concept,  8 for execution: 9 overall. :-&gt; A little more softness in the contrast/lighting might well have pumped it a bit higher, but still, very good. I hear the photo (which is my major grading criteria for this contest), and  it''s an appealing image overall. It seems a little burnt out/overexposed on her face. This was something I''d thought to do, but I couldn''t find anyone willing to scream for me on camera, so I had to go with something else! Good DOF.</td>', '10 for concept,  8 for execution: 9 overall. :-> A little more softness in the contrast/lighting might well have pumped it a bit higher, but still, very good. I hear the photo (which is my major grading criteria for this contest), and  it''s an appealing image overall. It seems a little burnt out/overexposed on her face. This was something I''d thought to do, but I couldn''t find anyone willing to scream for me on camera, so I had to go with something else! Good DOF.', '2003-06-02 10:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(312592, 23002, 8488, '<td valign="top">10 for concept,  8 for execution: 9 overall. :-&gt; A little more drama in the colorst/lighting might well have pumped it a bit higher, but still, very good. I hear the photo (which is my major grading criteria for this contest), and  it''s an appealing image overall. Love the combination of blurs and crisp/sharp focus.</td>', '10 for concept,  8 for execution: 9 overall. :-> A little more drama in the colorst/lighting might well have pumped it a bit higher, but still, very good. I hear the photo (which is my major grading criteria for this contest), and  it''s an appealing image overall. Love the combination of blurs and crisp/sharp focus.', '2003-06-02 10:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(312593, 23527, 806, '<td valign="top">sound, action, emotion, photojournalism! awesome image.. <br/>technically, I wish it were a bit crisper.... that is the only thing keeping me from scoring this a 10.</td>', 'sound, action, emotion, photojournalism! awesome image.. technically, I wish it were a bit crisper.... that is the only thing keeping me from scoring this a 10.', '2003-06-02 10:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(312594, 23476, 8488, '<td valign="top">10 for concept,  7 for execution: 8 overall. :-&gt; A little more drama in the colors/lighting might well have pumped it a bit higher, but still, very good. I hear the photo (which is my major grading criteria for this contest), and  it''s an appealing image overall. It has something of the feel of a snapshot (not sure why).</td>', '10 for concept,  7 for execution: 8 overall. :-> A little more drama in the colors/lighting might well have pumped it a bit higher, but still, very good. I hear the photo (which is my major grading criteria for this contest), and  it''s an appealing image overall. It has something of the feel of a snapshot (not sure why).', '2003-06-02 10:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(312595, 23168, 327, '<td valign="top">Good idea..I just think the focus is too soft, sorry. The color and composition is good.</td>', 'Good idea..I just think the focus is too soft, sorry. The color and composition is good.', '2003-06-02 10:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(312596, 22925, 8488, '<td valign="top">10 for concept,  6 for execution: 8 overall. :-&gt;  I hear the photo (which is my major grading criteria for this contest), and  it''s an appealing image overall. It''s got something of an indistinct snapshotty feel; maybe something in the contrast and focus?</td>', '10 for concept,  6 for execution: 8 overall. :->  I hear the photo (which is my major grading criteria for this contest), and  it''s an appealing image overall. It''s got something of an indistinct snapshotty feel; maybe something in the contrast and focus?', '2003-06-02 10:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(312597, 23394, 8488, '<td valign="top">10 for concept,  9 for execution: 9 overall. :-&gt;  I hear the photo (which is my major grading criteria for this contest), and  it''s an appealing image overall. Nice warm skin tones.</td>', '10 for concept,  9 for execution: 9 overall. :->  I hear the photo (which is my major grading criteria for this contest), and  it''s an appealing image overall. Nice warm skin tones.', '2003-06-02 10:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(312599, 22876, 8488, '<td valign="top">10 for concept,  8 for execution: 9 overall. :-&gt;  I hear the photo (which is my major grading criteria for this contest), and  it''s an appealing image overall. The little teeny flecks of glass all over the image make me feel like I need to wipe my monitor (though I know there''s not much you could do about that).</td>', '10 for concept,  8 for execution: 9 overall. :->  I hear the photo (which is my major grading criteria for this contest), and  it''s an appealing image overall. The little teeny flecks of glass all over the image make me feel like I need to wipe my monitor (though I know there''s not much you could do about that).', '2003-06-02 10:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(312600, 22971, 8488, '<td valign="top">10 for concept,  8 for execution: 9 overall. :-&gt; I hear the photo (which is my major grading criteria for this contest), and  it''s an appealing image overall. Good colors, good focus (esp. on the vibrations near the glass), but something about it just doesn''t ''pop'' for me and push it higher.</td>', '10 for concept,  8 for execution: 9 overall. :-> I hear the photo (which is my major grading criteria for this contest), and  it''s an appealing image overall. Good colors, good focus (esp. on the vibrations near the glass), but something about it just doesn''t ''pop'' for me and push it higher.', '2003-06-02 10:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(312601, 23528, 8488, '<td valign="top">10 for concept,  8 for execution: 9 overall. :-&gt; A little more drama in the colors/contrast might well have pumped it a bit higher, but still, very good. I hear the photo (which is my major grading criteria for this contest), and  it''s an appealing image overall. Good stop-motion. The lighting looks *slightly* washed out, to my untutored eye.</td>', '10 for concept,  8 for execution: 9 overall. :-> A little more drama in the colors/contrast might well have pumped it a bit higher, but still, very good. I hear the photo (which is my major grading criteria for this contest), and  it''s an appealing image overall. Good stop-motion. The lighting looks *slightly* washed out, to my untutored eye.', '2003-06-02 10:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(312602, 23516, 327, '<td valign="top">Camping?..Fun! <br/>Good idea but IMHO this is not a very appealing shot. <br/>Maybe if the bacon was arranged perfectly in the cast iron skillet and the grease drained off. Unrealistic I know....... I don''t eat bacon so maybe thats my problem....?Still I think the composition/focus is good.</td>', 'Camping?..Fun! Good idea but IMHO this is not a very appealing shot. Maybe if the bacon was arranged perfectly in the cast iron skillet and the grease drained off. Unrealistic I know....... I don''t eat bacon so maybe thats my problem....?Still I think the composition/focus is good.', '2003-06-02 10:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(312603, 23345, 8488, '<td valign="top">10 for concept,  9 for execution: 9 overall. :-&gt;  I hear the photo (which is my major grading criteria for this contest), and  it''s an appealing image overall. I liked this one a lot better than the other water shots, because it feels ''noisier'', somehow.</td>', '10 for concept,  9 for execution: 9 overall. :->  I hear the photo (which is my major grading criteria for this contest), and  it''s an appealing image overall. I liked this one a lot better than the other water shots, because it feels ''noisier'', somehow.', '2003-06-02 10:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(312604, 23425, 772, '<td valign="top">beautiful soft portrait... I think the simple fact that the headphones are not a dominant part if this image is part of what makes it work so well for me.  the catch light in the eyes is also perfect.  great black and white as well... - 10</td>', 'beautiful soft portrait... I think the simple fact that the headphones are not a dominant part if this image is part of what makes it work so well for me.  the catch light in the eyes is also perfect.  great black and white as well... - 10', '2003-06-02 10:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(312605, 22947, 8488, '<td valign="top">10 for concept,  9 for execution: 10 overall. :-&gt; I hear the photo (which is my major grading criteria for this contest), and  it''s an appealing image overall. I hope you won''t mind if the sound it evokes for me is the hiss and pop of running around and around the last groove near the label again and again!</td>', '10 for concept,  9 for execution: 10 overall. :-> I hear the photo (which is my major grading criteria for this contest), and  it''s an appealing image overall. I hope you won''t mind if the sound it evokes for me is the hiss and pop of running around and around the last groove near the label again and again!', '2003-06-02 10:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(312606, 23517, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, composition and color. I personally see the light as a bit harsh but just in a few places. Easily fixed with post processing after the challenge. Nice job.</td>', 'Nice subject, composition and color. I personally see the light as a bit harsh but just in a few places. Easily fixed with post processing after the challenge. Nice job.', '2003-06-02 10:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(312607, 23220, 327, '<td valign="top">Good idea~ Boom.</td>', 'Good idea~ Boom.', '2003-06-02 10:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(312611, 23539, 327, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. Little bit of a shadow and a few minor flash spots....However your focus and tones are really nice and I like the composition very much. This is nicely done.</td>', 'Interesting shot. Little bit of a shadow and a few minor flash spots....However your focus and tones are really nice and I like the composition very much. This is nicely done.', '2003-06-02 10:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(312613, 23463, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot.</td>', 'Pretty shot.', '2003-06-02 10:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(312614, 23496, 327, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, nice tones....</td>', 'Lovely shot, nice tones....', '2003-06-02 10:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
