(312621, 23353, 8488, '<td valign="top">10 for concept,  8 for execution: 9 overall. :-&gt; There''s a strange overall red-brownness to it that I''m not sure how to quantify, but still, very good. I hear the photo (which is my major grading criteria for this contest), and  it''s an appealing image overall.</td>', '10 for concept,  8 for execution: 9 overall. :-> There''s a strange overall red-brownness to it that I''m not sure how to quantify, but still, very good. I hear the photo (which is my major grading criteria for this contest), and  it''s an appealing image overall.', '2003-06-02 10:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
