(312623, 23546, 8488, '<td valign="top">10 for concept,  6 for execution: 7 overall. :-&gt; A little more clarity and less muddiness might well have pumped it a bit higher, but still, very good. I hear the photo (which is my major grading criteria for this contest), and it''s an appealing image.</td>', '10 for concept,  6 for execution: 7 overall. :-> A little more clarity and less muddiness might well have pumped it a bit higher, but still, very good. I hear the photo (which is my major grading criteria for this contest), and it''s an appealing image.', '2003-06-02 10:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
