(312626, 23401, 8488, '<td valign="top">Hrm. It''s a very, very pretty photograph, but if it''s doing that with the smoke it''s *not* making sound. :-&gt; I can''t ''hear'' the picture, so I have to grade it down, despite the lickable beauty of the shot. 6.</td>', 'Hrm. It''s a very, very pretty photograph, but if it''s doing that with the smoke it''s *not* making sound. :-> I can''t ''hear'' the picture, so I have to grade it down, despite the lickable beauty of the shot. 6.', '2003-06-02 10:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
