(312916, 23494, 5391, '<td valign="top">This is a great image, one of the best of the keyboard images this week.  Great dynamic shot from including the diagonal placement of the keyboard, and having one hand still while the other moves lets the viewer know that this was a very intentional motion-blur.  A little blown out in spots, but somehow that adds to this image for me.  I can almost hear the music.  10</td>', 'This is a great image, one of the best of the keyboard images this week.  Great dynamic shot from including the diagonal placement of the keyboard, and having one hand still while the other moves lets the viewer know that this was a very intentional motion-blur.  A little blown out in spots, but somehow that adds to this image for me.  I can almost hear the music.  10', '2003-06-02 15:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(312918, 23379, 5391, '<td valign="top">Possibly the most unique and perhaps my favorite image from the challenge.  That hand over the mouth, surpressing a giggle, and the squinted eyes, really make this image ''speak''.  It truly feels as if you''ve caught an intimate moment, and the hushed voices and laughter just flows from this shot.  Brilliant work.  10</td>', 'Possibly the most unique and perhaps my favorite image from the challenge.  That hand over the mouth, surpressing a giggle, and the squinted eyes, really make this image ''speak''.  It truly feels as if you''ve caught an intimate moment, and the hushed voices and laughter just flows from this shot.  Brilliant work.  10', '2003-06-02 15:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(312919, 23518, 5391, '<td valign="top">One of the better instrument shots of this challenge, I think.  I love your dynamic composition, and the tones are wonderful.  The concentration on the subject''s face and she slight blur of the background arm really make you feel as if he''s playing and convey the music of the shot.  Congrats.  A winner.  10</td>', 'One of the better instrument shots of this challenge, I think.  I love your dynamic composition, and the tones are wonderful.  The concentration on the subject''s face and she slight blur of the background arm really make you feel as if he''s playing and convey the music of the shot.  Congrats.  A winner.  10', '2003-06-02 15:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(312920, 23547, 5391, '<td valign="top">Wonderful tonal qualities and excellent composition.  Very much conveys the spirit of the challenge.  10</td>', 'Wonderful tonal qualities and excellent composition.  Very much conveys the spirit of the challenge.  10', '2003-06-02 15:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(312927, 23525, 5475, '<td valign="top">Looks more like gush gush than drip drip.<br/>Nicely done.  Love the stop action.<br/>JD Anderson</td>', 'Looks more like gush gush than drip drip.Nicely done.  Love the stop action.JD Anderson', '2003-06-02 15:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
