(312961, 23433, 7350, '<td valign="top">It looks like there was a lot of stuff going on here.  While the idea is good, and definitely meets the challenge, this has a "snapshot" feel to it.  The sky is quite washed out and the colors are a little dull.</td>', 'It looks like there was a lot of stuff going on here.  While the idea is good, and definitely meets the challenge, this has a "snapshot" feel to it.  The sky is quite washed out and the colors are a little dull.', '2003-06-02 16:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
