(312964, 23537, 7350, '<td valign="top">Excellent timing on catching such a great splash!  Perhaps the lighting is a little dark on the boy''s face.  I''m not sure what you could do about it, though.</td>', 'Excellent timing on catching such a great splash!  Perhaps the lighting is a little dark on the boy''s face.  I''m not sure what you could do about it, though.', '2003-06-02 16:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
