(312975, 23165, 7350, '<td valign="top">This is the best shot of an instrument I''ve seen so far.  The reflection is great, the lighting works well, and the focus is right where it needs to be.  Congratulations. 10.</td>', 'This is the best shot of an instrument I''ve seen so far.  The reflection is great, the lighting works well, and the focus is right where it needs to be.  Congratulations. 10.', '2003-06-02 16:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
