(312978, 23345, 7350, '<td valign="top">Perhaps with this waterfall, instead of using a prolonged exposure, you could have captured the exact splash effect with a very quick shutter speed.  This makes it just look out of focus to me.</td>', 'Perhaps with this waterfall, instead of using a prolonged exposure, you could have captured the exact splash effect with a very quick shutter speed.  This makes it just look out of focus to me.', '2003-06-02 16:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
