(313022, 23544, 7350, '<td valign="top">The lighting is perfect.  It takes a second here though to see that the clock is ringing right now.  Perhaps a macro of just the bells and the clapper?  Anyway, 7.</td>', 'The lighting is perfect.  It takes a second here though to see that the clock is ringing right now.  Perhaps a macro of just the bells and the clapper?  Anyway, 7.', '2003-06-02 16:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(313024, 23394, 7350, '<td valign="top">Touching.  I like how the skin tone is so even from the mother to the child...</td>', 'Touching.  I like how the skin tone is so even from the mother to the child...', '2003-06-02 16:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(313026, 23511, 8522, '<td valign="top">I really like this one... great dof, very sharp. Nice lighting. Good interpretation of the challenge... quirky!  Well composed. 9</td>', 'I really like this one... great dof, very sharp. Nice lighting. Good interpretation of the challenge... quirky!  Well composed. 9', '2003-06-02 16:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(313028, 23433, 8522, '<td valign="top">An intriguing picture... what''s going on?! The desaturated colours other than red work well here.  Nice piece of photojournalism. 9</td>', 'An intriguing picture... what''s going on?! The desaturated colours other than red work well here.  Nice piece of photojournalism. 9', '2003-06-02 16:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(313029, 23528, 8522, '<td valign="top">Shame it''s so grainy, other than that, a superb picture. Nice concept, good interpretation of challenge. Good use of colour. 9</td>', 'Shame it''s so grainy, other than that, a superb picture. Nice concept, good interpretation of challenge. Good use of colour. 9', '2003-06-02 16:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(313030, 22876, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great concept, it would be interesting to know how it was achieved! The glass is superb, as are the shattering fragments. It''s perhaps a little too grainy for my taste here though. 9</td>', 'Great concept, it would be interesting to know how it was achieved! The glass is superb, as are the shattering fragments. It''s perhaps a little too grainy for my taste here though. 9', '2003-06-02 16:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(313037, 23320, 8530, '<td valign="top">Oh, neat. I had a very simple one of these as a kid, and I was always fascinated by how it worked, so to see a macro shot of the workings is very nostalgic for me. Which translates to "great choice of subject".</td>', 'Oh, neat. I had a very simple one of these as a kid, and I was always fascinated by how it worked, so to see a macro shot of the workings is very nostalgic for me. Which translates to "great choice of subject".', '2003-06-02 17:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(313039, 22876, 8530, '<td valign="top">Do I want to know how many glasses you broke shooting this? I''m curious if the method of breaking really was sound -- I presume the thing on the left is part of a speaker although it''s hard to tell absent larger context (I had to think about whether an uncovered speaker would look like that). What are the bubbles (or bubble-like artifacts) throughout? Those are somewhat distracting, but I have no idea if they''re unavoidable.</td>', 'Do I want to know how many glasses you broke shooting this? I''m curious if the method of breaking really was sound -- I presume the thing on the left is part of a speaker although it''s hard to tell absent larger context (I had to think about whether an uncovered speaker would look like that). What are the bubbles (or bubble-like artifacts) throughout? Those are somewhat distracting, but I have no idea if they''re unavoidable.', '2003-06-02 17:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(313040, 23178, 7707, '<td valign="top">this is a really nice picture, but I don''t see the "sound" in the picture.</td>', 'this is a really nice picture, but I don''t see the "sound" in the picture.', '2003-06-02 17:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(313041, 23131, 8530, '<td valign="top">Clever choice of subject; in the context of the challenge it''s interesting, although outside of it not so much. Very clean toilet, very dirty-looking fingernail (and what looks like a papercut as well); I suppose in this case that my eye keeps going back to the finger is a good thing, however.</td>', 'Clever choice of subject; in the context of the challenge it''s interesting, although outside of it not so much. Very clean toilet, very dirty-looking fingernail (and what looks like a papercut as well); I suppose in this case that my eye keeps going back to the finger is a good thing, however.', '2003-06-02 17:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(313042, 23466, 7707, '<td valign="top">I hope this speaker was old....great pic</td>', 'I hope this speaker was old....great pic', '2003-06-02 17:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(313043, 23335, 8530, '<td valign="top">Wow, slomo roman candle! That''s neat; I love the arcs of light following the sparks, and at least the feel that the lighting is provided only by it even if that''s not the case. For me, though, this sort of firework is more visual than aural; I don''t consider it off-topic at all but it''s not as strong a topical image as it might have been with a different type of firework shot (and will no doubt be stronger for others).</td>', 'Wow, slomo roman candle! That''s neat; I love the arcs of light following the sparks, and at least the feel that the lighting is provided only by it even if that''s not the case. For me, though, this sort of firework is more visual than aural; I don''t consider it off-topic at all but it''s not as strong a topical image as it might have been with a different type of firework shot (and will no doubt be stronger for others).', '2003-06-02 17:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(313046, 23421, 8530, '<td valign="top">Nice wave/spray of water. Too bad you couldn''t get a more tightly-focussed shot of it, since there''s all this empty space between you and it that ends up detracting a bit. In terms of topic, yes, very evocative, but then, I grew up next to this big wet thing.</td>', 'Nice wave/spray of water. Too bad you couldn''t get a more tightly-focussed shot of it, since there''s all this empty space between you and it that ends up detracting a bit. In terms of topic, yes, very evocative, but then, I grew up next to this big wet thing.', '2003-06-02 17:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(313047, 23502, 8530, '<td valign="top">It took me quite some time to realize this was a harmonica, and I''m still not sure I''m right. Maybe it''s the angle, maybe the lighting, maybe a bit of both. It being unclear to me de-emphasized the impact of topic.</td>', 'It took me quite some time to realize this was a harmonica, and I''m still not sure I''m right. Maybe it''s the angle, maybe the lighting, maybe a bit of both. It being unclear to me de-emphasized the impact of topic.', '2003-06-02 17:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(313048, 23130, 8530, '<td valign="top">Sound modulation evokes sound. True. In terms of a picture, however, somewhat uninteresting. An electronic equalizer with a cool pattern or background would have made it more interesting.</td>', 'Sound modulation evokes sound. True. In terms of a picture, however, somewhat uninteresting. An electronic equalizer with a cool pattern or background would have made it more interesting.', '2003-06-02 17:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(313049, 23394, 8530, '<td valign="top">I probably would not have thought of sound without the title, although maybe after giving it a while. It''s a well-composed photo but it doesn''t grab me in terms of the topic. Highlights on the skin maybe a bit too bright? Hard to tell how much of that is skin tone.</td>', 'I probably would not have thought of sound without the title, although maybe after giving it a while. It''s a well-composed photo but it doesn''t grab me in terms of the topic. Highlights on the skin maybe a bit too bright? Hard to tell how much of that is skin tone.', '2003-06-02 17:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(313053, 23529, 8530, '<td valign="top">Good angle! She looks amused -- I would have guessed laughing or playful yelling if not for the title, although I suppose one can have a playful scream -- but that''s fine, it still evokes the concept of sound.</td>', 'Good angle! She looks amused -- I would have guessed laughing or playful yelling if not for the title, although I suppose one can have a playful scream -- but that''s fine, it still evokes the concept of sound.', '2003-06-02 17:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(313058, 23345, 8530, '<td valign="top">Heh, I almost went out to take a photo of a fountain, so I definitely agree falling water is evocative of sound. Something about the photo looks odd -- I suspect in part the lack of colour. Inasmuch as seeing the foam swirl is nice, the clear falling water seems blurry, which is probably related.</td>', 'Heh, I almost went out to take a photo of a fountain, so I definitely agree falling water is evocative of sound. Something about the photo looks odd -- I suspect in part the lack of colour. Inasmuch as seeing the foam swirl is nice, the clear falling water seems blurry, which is probably related.', '2003-06-02 17:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(313061, 23529, 7889, '<td valign="top">This is the one for me - excellent - top marks<br/></td>', 'This is the one for me - excellent - top marks', '2003-06-02 17:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(313069, 23503, 332, '<td valign="top">The picture clearly fits the challenge. The contrast is good. Good composition and the border works well. Good job.</td>', 'The picture clearly fits the challenge. The contrast is good. Good composition and the border works well. Good job.', '2003-06-02 17:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
