(313110, 23518, 8530, '<td valign="top">Ahh, good, a guitar picture that actually features a player. This was one of the ideas I ended up rejecting (you did it better than I would have anyhow), so obviously I think it''s on topic. I like the composition, though I would have liked to see maybe a little more lighting on the front of the guitar/fretboard. What is being played?</td>', 'Ahh, good, a guitar picture that actually features a player. This was one of the ideas I ended up rejecting (you did it better than I would have anyhow), so obviously I think it''s on topic. I like the composition, though I would have liked to see maybe a little more lighting on the front of the guitar/fretboard. What is being played?', '2003-06-02 18:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(313113, 23353, 8530, '<td valign="top">Windchime, very evocative. Nicely framed against the branches, good DOF. Too bad it''s not a prettier windchime, although the weathered look is fine.</td>', 'Windchime, very evocative. Nicely framed against the branches, good DOF. Too bad it''s not a prettier windchime, although the weathered look is fine.', '2003-06-02 18:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
