(313122, 23360, 8530, '<td valign="top">A candid-looking shot. It does evoke the topic. Lighting seems a bit harsh and the right arm being cut off doesn''t appeal to me.</td>', 'A candid-looking shot. It does evoke the topic. Lighting seems a bit harsh and the right arm being cut off doesn''t appeal to me.', '2003-06-02 18:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(313124, 23328, 7350, '<td valign="top">Something about the harsh white lines between the keys doesn''t sit well with me.</td>', 'Something about the harsh white lines between the keys doesn''t sit well with me.', '2003-06-02 18:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(313126, 22971, 8530, '<td valign="top">I assume either running your finger along the glass or tapping it because of the title, but without the title I would never have tied this to the topic. The finger may be required to establish the topic (however loosely) but it looks very out of place as is.</td>', 'I assume either running your finger along the glass or tapping it because of the title, but without the title I would never have tied this to the topic. The finger may be required to establish the topic (however loosely) but it looks very out of place as is.', '2003-06-02 18:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(313129, 23530, 8530, '<td valign="top">Title aside, this doesn''t really scream ''sound'' to me, although I can sort of see it as on topic. This looks very strange, overly blue -- is it tinted? Also the framing seems off -- either too much negative space or possibly not enough.</td>', 'Title aside, this doesn''t really scream ''sound'' to me, although I can sort of see it as on topic. This looks very strange, overly blue -- is it tinted? Also the framing seems off -- either too much negative space or possibly not enough.', '2003-06-02 18:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(313132, 23528, 8530, '<td valign="top">Better, of course, would have been the balloon actually popping, as difficult as that might be to capture. This actually more looks like something balanced on a dart and turned sideways than something about to pop. I do like the highlight -- window or whatever -- on the balloon, it gives it an interesting drawn look<br/> <br/>Because there''s no sense of motion and the balloon is still intact, it didn''t strongly resonate (no pun intended) with the topic for me.</td>', 'Better, of course, would have been the balloon actually popping, as difficult as that might be to capture. This actually more looks like something balanced on a dart and turned sideways than something about to pop. I do like the highlight -- window or whatever -- on the balloon, it gives it an interesting drawn look Because there''s no sense of motion and the balloon is still intact, it didn''t strongly resonate (no pun intended) with the topic for me.', '2003-06-02 18:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(313145, 23517, 2752, '<td valign="top">very well done..great composition,colors and positioning..excellent clarity&gt;(10)</td>', 'very well done..great composition,colors and positioning..excellent clarity>(10)', '2003-06-02 18:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(313148, 23220, 2752, '<td valign="top">great capture of the firing..I can just hear the "bang".  The landscape reminds me of an Andrew Wyeth painting.(7)</td>', 'great capture of the firing..I can just hear the "bang".  The landscape reminds me of an Andrew Wyeth painting.(7)', '2003-06-02 18:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(313151, 23463, 2752, '<td valign="top">lovely composition and colors...can even imagine "humming" in the wires.(8)</td>', 'lovely composition and colors...can even imagine "humming" in the wires.(8)', '2003-06-02 18:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(313155, 22855, 554, '<td valign="top">FANTASTIC!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!......10+</td>', 'FANTASTIC!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!......10+', '2003-06-02 18:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(313161, 23523, 6900, '<td valign="top">Nice dark shadow - looks a bit blurry.</td>', 'Nice dark shadow - looks a bit blurry.', '2003-06-02 19:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(313163, 23234, 6900, '<td valign="top">Wish we could see more of his face, or it was less in focus.  Nice composition. 8</td>', 'Wish we could see more of his face, or it was less in focus.  Nice composition. 8', '2003-06-02 19:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(313164, 23168, 8530, '<td valign="top">At first I thought you used a lot of butter, but actually I guess that''s broken yolk. This shot is too blurry. I do like the idea, though.</td>', 'At first I thought you used a lot of butter, but actually I guess that''s broken yolk. This shot is too blurry. I do like the idea, though.', '2003-06-02 19:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(313165, 23464, 8530, '<td valign="top">The lighting, automatic though it may be, really makes this shot stand out. It''s a reasonable topic, does evoke sound since the light makes it clearly ''on''.</td>', 'The lighting, automatic though it may be, really makes this shot stand out. It''s a reasonable topic, does evoke sound since the light makes it clearly ''on''.', '2003-06-02 19:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(313166, 23407, 6900, '<td valign="top">Had the same idea - didn''t have Rice Krispies!  Nice execution here.</td>', 'Had the same idea - didn''t have Rice Krispies!  Nice execution here.', '2003-06-02 19:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(313167, 23054, 8530, '<td valign="top">A guitar by itself with no one playing it does little to evoke sound for me, I''m afraid. Concentrating on the opening and its circles is an interesting idea, though.</td>', 'A guitar by itself with no one playing it does little to evoke sound for me, I''m afraid. Concentrating on the opening and its circles is an interesting idea, though.', '2003-06-02 19:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(313168, 23538, 6900, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the red tone overall to this, but I love the concept.  I wish there was smoke or something coming out to show action.</td>', 'I don''t like the red tone overall to this, but I love the concept.  I wish there was smoke or something coming out to show action.', '2003-06-02 19:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(313171, 23324, 6900, '<td valign="top">Talk is definitely sound - Interesting DoF - I wonder if it''s on purpose.  Great shot.</td>', 'Talk is definitely sound - Interesting DoF - I wonder if it''s on purpose.  Great shot.', '2003-06-02 19:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(313172, 23532, 6900, '<td valign="top">Great color!  Excellent composition here.  Nice day too, it looks like.</td>', 'Great color!  Excellent composition here.  Nice day too, it looks like.', '2003-06-02 19:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(313174, 23197, 6900, '<td valign="top">Very cool - looks like capoeira.</td>', 'Very cool - looks like capoeira.', '2003-06-02 19:06:54.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(313177, 23185, 6900, '<td valign="top">Would''ve been better in color, I think.</td>', 'Would''ve been better in color, I think.', '2003-06-02 19:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(313179, 23394, 6900, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting - perfect expression and composition.  The utter nakedness of both models actually works for this shot.  10</td>', 'Excellent lighting - perfect expression and composition.  The utter nakedness of both models actually works for this shot.  10', '2003-06-02 19:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(313184, 23517, 6900, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Except that the headphones blend in with the black bg, this is a technically amazing shot.  It''s also interesting. 9</td>', 'Wow!  Except that the headphones blend in with the black bg, this is a technically amazing shot.  It''s also interesting. 9', '2003-06-02 19:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(313193, 22947, 8530, '<td valign="top">Wow, I thought I was the only person left in the world with an actual record player (and vinyl). It works for me as a subject. Interesting lighting; good closeup shot.</td>', 'Wow, I thought I was the only person left in the world with an actual record player (and vinyl). It works for me as a subject. Interesting lighting; good closeup shot.', '2003-06-02 19:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(313194, 23472, 8530, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid I see absolutely no relation to the challenge in this photo.</td>', 'I''m afraid I see absolutely no relation to the challenge in this photo.', '2003-06-02 19:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(313196, 23453, 8530, '<td valign="top">Mmm, well... okay, I concede that to some this will evoke sound, even if that wasn''t my first thought, so ''on topic'' but only on second thought. Aside from that -- neat photo; I didn''t know birds had tongues! You learn something new every day.</td>', 'Mmm, well... okay, I concede that to some this will evoke sound, even if that wasn''t my first thought, so ''on topic'' but only on second thought. Aside from that -- neat photo; I didn''t know birds had tongues! You learn something new every day.', '2003-06-02 19:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(313197, 23514, 8530, '<td valign="top">whissssSSSSSSsssssSSSSSSSssssssSSSSS<br/>Okay! Yes, this definitely meets the challenge. The clutter on the left is a little distracting, as is the doorway. The TV actually having a visible antenna is good emphasis the subject, although, heh, you may not have had a choice there (I used to think I was the last person in the wired world without cable, but maybe I was mistaken). (Also, I have it now.) (Well, directTV, and it''s not like you care about this at all, but I got 2 hours of sleep, which tends to make for the occasional bizarre comments.)<br/> <br/>Anyhow. Cropped to get rid of the left clutter would lose you part of the antenna, so I suppose I''d recommend a slightly different angle for a bit more impact, but overall I like the idea.</td>', 'whissssSSSSSSsssssSSSSSSSssssssSSSSSOkay! Yes, this definitely meets the challenge. The clutter on the left is a little distracting, as is the doorway. The TV actually having a visible antenna is good emphasis the subject, although, heh, you may not have had a choice there (I used to think I was the last person in the wired world without cable, but maybe I was mistaken). (Also, I have it now.) (Well, directTV, and it''s not like you care about this at all, but I got 2 hours of sleep, which tends to make for the occasional bizarre comments.) Anyhow. Cropped to get rid of the left clutter would lose you part of the antenna, so I suppose I''d recommend a slightly different angle for a bit more impact, but overall I like the idea.', '2003-06-02 19:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(313198, 23155, 8530, '<td valign="top">What a strange effect. I''m very curious how you did it. <br/> <br/>I think the idea is a good one, but I dont'' really care for this result; the patches of colour seem to be random artifacts rather than  intentional, and the abstract feel lended as a result is, unfortunately for you, not something I care for. (Well, it may not be unfortunate; it''s not like you were out to impress me specifically, but, er, okay, I''m getting sidetracked again, really must sleep more before writing these...)</td>', 'What a strange effect. I''m very curious how you did it.  I think the idea is a good one, but I dont'' really care for this result; the patches of colour seem to be random artifacts rather than  intentional, and the abstract feel lended as a result is, unfortunately for you, not something I care for. (Well, it may not be unfortunate; it''s not like you were out to impress me specifically, but, er, okay, I''m getting sidetracked again, really must sleep more before writing these...)', '2003-06-02 19:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(313200, 23299, 8530, '<td valign="top">The inner edge aside, the subject isn''t immediate obvious. It''s sort of pretty, in an abstract fashion, but I''m not a big fan of abstract. Since I had to stop and think, even for a few seconds, what this was, it lessened the topical impact for me.</td>', 'The inner edge aside, the subject isn''t immediate obvious. It''s sort of pretty, in an abstract fashion, but I''m not a big fan of abstract. Since I had to stop and think, even for a few seconds, what this was, it lessened the topical impact for me.', '2003-06-02 19:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(313203, 23516, 8530, '<td valign="top">Mmm. BaaaAAAAaaacon.<br/> <br/>Take several shots? Half your bacon is nearly uncooked and half seems done, and there''s a lot of grease. This is not as immaterial as it sounds; it seems less natural than it could.<br/> <br/>I do, however, like the idea; bacon (frying things in general) has a very distinct sound, and the cast-iron pan on the grate is visually interesting, and oh my god that sounded pretentious. But ''pretty'' isn''t the right word, so, I''ll stick with the old VI.<br/> <br/>Did you eat the bacon after?</td>', 'Mmm. BaaaAAAAaaacon. Take several shots? Half your bacon is nearly uncooked and half seems done, and there''s a lot of grease. This is not as immaterial as it sounds; it seems less natural than it could. I do, however, like the idea; bacon (frying things in general) has a very distinct sound, and the cast-iron pan on the grate is visually interesting, and oh my god that sounded pretentious. But ''pretty'' isn''t the right word, so, I''ll stick with the old VI. Did you eat the bacon after?', '2003-06-02 19:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(313204, 22947, 6900, '<td valign="top">OOPS on the typo.  In a previous existence you were a dj or you played lps?  I like this shot, but being a young hip hopper I''d have called it "Two Turntables and a Microphone"  lol  Great shot 9</td>', 'OOPS on the typo.  In a previous existence you were a dj or you played lps?  I like this shot, but being a young hip hopper I''d have called it "Two Turntables and a Microphone"  lol  Great shot 9', '2003-06-02 19:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(313205, 23401, 6900, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting - good capture of the smoke and the swirls.  I like the diagonal composition  but wished there was just a hint of smoke from the last hole (or crop it)</td>', 'Beautiful lighting - good capture of the smoke and the swirls.  I like the diagonal composition  but wished there was just a hint of smoke from the last hole (or crop it)', '2003-06-02 19:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(313206, 23531, 8530, '<td valign="top">I''m, erm, still not sure I understand the setup. It definitely evokes noise -- very nifty motion blur on the hammer, btw, although the resulting blur on the pot is a little hard to focus the eye on -- but the concept leaves me boggled. Not physically abstract but metaphysically abstract? Good lighting, too.</td>', 'I''m, erm, still not sure I understand the setup. It definitely evokes noise -- very nifty motion blur on the hammer, btw, although the resulting blur on the pot is a little hard to focus the eye on -- but the concept leaves me boggled. Not physically abstract but metaphysically abstract? Good lighting, too.', '2003-06-02 19:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(313208, 23546, 8530, '<td valign="top">Hmm, seems a strange angle for a mic view, but okay. I like it''s an action shot, though with a "D-minor" title I think I''d rather have seen the chording than the strumming. The lighting or angle or toning or likely all three washes out the strings, which is a pity as they''re the center of focus. I don''t actually care for the toning, actually. The idea is good.</td>', 'Hmm, seems a strange angle for a mic view, but okay. I like it''s an action shot, though with a "D-minor" title I think I''d rather have seen the chording than the strumming. The lighting or angle or toning or likely all three washes out the strings, which is a pity as they''re the center of focus. I don''t actually care for the toning, actually. The idea is good.', '2003-06-02 19:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(313209, 23314, 6900, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit blurry and the reflections are a bit harsh - nice capture of the second hand passing 12 though.</td>', 'It''s a bit blurry and the reflections are a bit harsh - nice capture of the second hand passing 12 though.', '2003-06-02 19:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(313210, 23427, 8530, '<td valign="top">nice to see drums, first time I''ve run across them. Unfortunately like several other instrument images, static instruments without someone playing them does not do as much to evoke the concept of ''sound''. I do like the way this is set up, and the glow on the bottom left''s hide. Can''t tell what kind of drums the left ones are (tom-toms?), which I suppose is immaterial; I''m just naturally curious.</td>', 'nice to see drums, first time I''ve run across them. Unfortunately like several other instrument images, static instruments without someone playing them does not do as much to evoke the concept of ''sound''. I do like the way this is set up, and the glow on the bottom left''s hide. Can''t tell what kind of drums the left ones are (tom-toms?), which I suppose is immaterial; I''m just naturally curious.', '2003-06-02 19:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(313211, 23168, 6900, '<td valign="top">Sizzle, sizzle, pop, pop<br/>these eggs you did drop<br/>but I wish it was sharp more<br/>you''d get a better score.</td>', 'Sizzle, sizzle, pop, popthese eggs you did dropbut I wish it was sharp moreyou''d get a better score.', '2003-06-02 19:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(313212, 23155, 6900, '<td valign="top">Don''t like the post processing - interesting subject idea, however.</td>', 'Don''t like the post processing - interesting subject idea, however.', '2003-06-02 19:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(313213, 23532, 8530, '<td valign="top">If the shot included obviously lit emergency lights, it would have had a bit more impact for me in terms of ''sound''; I am not certain if they just aren''t on or if the lighting conditions keep it from being obvious. I do like the shot; it''s a very crisp photo and framed well.</td>', 'If the shot included obviously lit emergency lights, it would have had a bit more impact for me in terms of ''sound''; I am not certain if they just aren''t on or if the lighting conditions keep it from being obvious. I do like the shot; it''s a very crisp photo and framed well.', '2003-06-02 19:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(313214, 23524, 8530, '<td valign="top">This is a very, very neat shot in terms of lighting and composition in general. Unfortunately, even though there''s a belated connection to the topic in my mind, the initial impression was not of sound, but of light and shadow.</td>', 'This is a very, very neat shot in terms of lighting and composition in general. Unfortunately, even though there''s a belated connection to the topic in my mind, the initial impression was not of sound, but of light and shadow.', '2003-06-02 19:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(313220, 22876, 6630, '<td valign="top">WOW. It must have taken many many shots to achieve this.....I can almost hear it.</td>', 'WOW. It must have taken many many shots to achieve this.....I can almost hear it.', '2003-06-02 20:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(313221, 23516, 6630, '<td valign="top">Yum!!!</td>', 'Yum!!!', '2003-06-02 20:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(313222, 23337, 6630, '<td valign="top">I think a better focus could have helped</td>', 'I think a better focus could have helped', '2003-06-02 20:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(313224, 23168, 6630, '<td valign="top">Did you mean for this pic to be out of focus?  I think good focus would have helped</td>', 'Did you mean for this pic to be out of focus?  I think good focus would have helped', '2003-06-02 20:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(313225, 23357, 6630, '<td valign="top">Is silence a sound?  I like the pic, but I''m not quite sure it meets the challenge.</td>', 'Is silence a sound?  I like the pic, but I''m not quite sure it meets the challenge.', '2003-06-02 20:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(313226, 23472, 6630, '<td valign="top">HUH?  What is this?  Am I missing something?</td>', 'HUH?  What is this?  Am I missing something?', '2003-06-02 20:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(313228, 23407, 6597, '<td valign="top">We''re all familar with this sound. I would have liked the whole bowl in the picture<br/>      6</td>', 'We''re all familar with this sound. I would have liked the whole bowl in the picture      6', '2003-06-02 20:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(313229, 22855, 6597, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge but would have liked the whole face in the picture  5</td>', 'Meets the challenge but would have liked the whole face in the picture  5', '2003-06-02 20:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(313230, 23370, 6597, '<td valign="top">This is certainly sound  6</td>', 'This is certainly sound  6', '2003-06-02 20:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(313231, 23453, 2752, '<td valign="top">very good job of creating a 3 dimensional duck..difficult with a black or white bird...the wll taken photo is well composed and stands out from the muted background.(10)</td>', 'very good job of creating a 3 dimensional duck..difficult with a black or white bird...the wll taken photo is well composed and stands out from the muted background.(10)', '2003-06-02 20:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(313232, 23537, 6597, '<td valign="top">splashin effect makes this photo 7</td>', 'splashin effect makes this photo 7', '2003-06-02 20:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(313233, 23518, 6597, '<td valign="top">These do make sound 7</td>', 'These do make sound 7', '2003-06-02 20:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(313234, 23421, 2752, '<td valign="top">can reeally feet the force and sound of waves crashing on the wall.  Good job.</td>', 'can reeally feet the force and sound of waves crashing on the wall.  Good job.', '2003-06-02 20:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(313235, 23549, 6597, '<td valign="top">good texture 6</td>', 'good texture 6', '2003-06-02 20:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(313236, 23546, 6597, '<td valign="top">these do make noiseI like the upside down view 7</td>', 'these do make noiseI like the upside down view 7', '2003-06-02 20:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(313241, 23533, 6597, '<td valign="top">meets the challenge I like the way the man looks so comfortable with the radio.<br/>There''s a little round circle just above his hand is there a purpose for that. 5<br/>     Sue</td>', 'meets the challenge I like the way the man looks so comfortable with the radio.There''s a little round circle just above his hand is there a purpose for that. 5     Sue', '2003-06-02 20:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(313245, 23537, 8530, '<td valign="top">This is a neat shot with the motion-capture of the splash and the individual motes of water, but inasmuch as splashing does have a distinctive sound, there isn''t that immediate gut ''sound'' reaction to it. On topic but a little loose of interpretation, I''d call it. I like the, well, I was going to say B&amp;W but it appears to have a very mild sepia tone to it, so, ''duotone'', nature of the photo.</td>', 'This is a neat shot with the motion-capture of the splash and the individual motes of water, but inasmuch as splashing does have a distinctive sound, there isn''t that immediate gut ''sound'' reaction to it. On topic but a little loose of interpretation, I''d call it. I like the, well, I was going to say B&W but it appears to have a very mild sepia tone to it, so, ''duotone'', nature of the photo.', '2003-06-02 20:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(313257, 23377, 8530, '<td valign="top">Well, I figured someone would enter something with this title, and I was right.<br/> <br/>I do like the shot -- though some of that is I like cemetery shots in general -- and B&amp;W in this case is a nice touch. I''m not sure how well I feel it meets the challenge; we could debate endlessly about if ''silence'' is a sound, and I see merit in both sides. I may have to think about this and revisit the score later when I''m sure. And no doubt you will have jillions of comments saying just that.<br/> <br/>About my only real technical objection is the overlight top of the photo, which gives it a washed out feel.</td>', 'Well, I figured someone would enter something with this title, and I was right. I do like the shot -- though some of that is I like cemetery shots in general -- and B&W in this case is a nice touch. I''m not sure how well I feel it meets the challenge; we could debate endlessly about if ''silence'' is a sound, and I see merit in both sides. I may have to think about this and revisit the score later when I''m sure. And no doubt you will have jillions of comments saying just that. About my only real technical objection is the overlight top of the photo, which gives it a washed out feel.', '2003-06-02 20:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(313260, 23234, 8530, '<td valign="top">Wow, what an amazingly neat subject for a photo. It does meet the challenge, in an unusual and strikign way. I''m trying to decide if I think the man should be a little further to the right so there''s no negative space on the right edge of the elbow; I think that might have been a little nicer. Top to bottom is fine, though.</td>', 'Wow, what an amazingly neat subject for a photo. It does meet the challenge, in an unusual and strikign way. I''m trying to decide if I think the man should be a little further to the right so there''s no negative space on the right edge of the elbow; I think that might have been a little nicer. Top to bottom is fine, though.', '2003-06-02 20:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(313270, 23314, 8530, '<td valign="top">At first I was wondering what the connection was to the topic, before it sunk in the alarm was ringing. This puts it in a range of photos where my initial impression wasn''t SOUND (in your face) but afterthought showed it to be correctly on topic, which may say as much about my perception as it does about the choice of topic.<br/> <br/>I think the ringing bell might stand out more with different lighting or a different background (or maybe even in colour, especially if this is brass-toned), which would have helped that initial impression. Otherwise, I like it.</td>', 'At first I was wondering what the connection was to the topic, before it sunk in the alarm was ringing. This puts it in a range of photos where my initial impression wasn''t SOUND (in your face) but afterthought showed it to be correctly on topic, which may say as much about my perception as it does about the choice of topic. I think the ringing bell might stand out more with different lighting or a different background (or maybe even in colour, especially if this is brass-toned), which would have helped that initial impression. Otherwise, I like it.', '2003-06-02 20:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(313275, 23507, 8530, '<td valign="top">Heh, after so many duotone images rated last week with non-coloured landscape scenes, it was actually a little strange to see a colour one. (Not bad, just a quick double-take.) Very nice, the capturing of the wake or wave against the pylon, which is definitely something that evokes sound for me -- I grew up near a large body of water. The background being such a bright green on the left is a little distracting but I''m not sure what all you could have done about that and still caught the water motion well.</td>', 'Heh, after so many duotone images rated last week with non-coloured landscape scenes, it was actually a little strange to see a colour one. (Not bad, just a quick double-take.) Very nice, the capturing of the wake or wave against the pylon, which is definitely something that evokes sound for me -- I grew up near a large body of water. The background being such a bright green on the left is a little distracting but I''m not sure what all you could have done about that and still caught the water motion well.', '2003-06-02 20:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(313278, 23394, 738, '<td valign="top">i cant vote on your photo but it''s the best shot i''ve seen on dpc ever</td>', 'i cant vote on your photo but it''s the best shot i''ve seen on dpc ever', '2003-06-02 20:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(313281, 23357, 8530, '<td valign="top">HmmmmMMMm, another ''silence is sound'' shot that I have to think about. Postcard-pretty, although I think a tighter focus on the fisherman would have been preferable for the topic; as is, it''s almost a little distracting to have him there. Possibly I might have had more of a ''sound'' reaction if this were earlier in the morning, a time I recall fishing in on vacation which does indeed have its own special sounds; but a mid-day shot is definitely more ''silent'' and therein lies the ambiguity for me on how well I feel it meets the challenge.</td>', 'HmmmmMMMm, another ''silence is sound'' shot that I have to think about. Postcard-pretty, although I think a tighter focus on the fisherman would have been preferable for the topic; as is, it''s almost a little distracting to have him there. Possibly I might have had more of a ''sound'' reaction if this were earlier in the morning, a time I recall fishing in on vacation which does indeed have its own special sounds; but a mid-day shot is definitely more ''silent'' and therein lies the ambiguity for me on how well I feel it meets the challenge.', '2003-06-02 21:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(313282, 23308, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but I''m afraid I don''t like the finish of the violin.It also seems a bit battered! I would personally have taken the picture from the other side of the violin, so a thicker string could have been put in motion by the bow. 6</td>', 'Nice composition, but I''m afraid I don''t like the finish of the violin.It also seems a bit battered! I would personally have taken the picture from the other side of the violin, so a thicker string could have been put in motion by the bow. 6', '2003-06-02 21:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(313285, 23496, 8530, '<td valign="top">I think I would have preferred this in colour; the foam is a little too-bright at the bottom left. (I''m resisting the urge to say "Hey! Duotones is so five minutes ago!" :P But I will admit I''m not a huge B&amp;W outdoor scenery fan...) It does work in terms of the topic and I like that the rock is the center of focus. The motion of the water gives a blurry effect on the left I''m not liking as much but you''d lose a little ''sound'' emphasis without it, I suppose.</td>', 'I think I would have preferred this in colour; the foam is a little too-bright at the bottom left. (I''m resisting the urge to say "Hey! Duotones is so five minutes ago!" :P But I will admit I''m not a huge B&W outdoor scenery fan...) It does work in terms of the topic and I like that the rock is the center of focus. The motion of the water gives a blurry effect on the left I''m not liking as much but you''d lose a little ''sound'' emphasis without it, I suppose.', '2003-06-02 21:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(313286, 23156, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but I think it would have looked clearer with a thicker string in motion. 7</td>', 'Nice idea, but I think it would have looked clearer with a thicker string in motion. 7', '2003-06-02 21:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(313296, 23531, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, great expression caught. I think the right hand (and object held) have moved too quickly here though. This would have been great with a tad quicker shutter speed. Maybe the right hand blurred just enough so you can make out what she''s holding... or using flash at the end of the exposure. It would also be nice to have the saucepan in focus? (ie not moving). 7</td>', 'Nice photo, great expression caught. I think the right hand (and object held) have moved too quickly here though. This would have been great with a tad quicker shutter speed. Maybe the right hand blurred just enough so you can make out what she''s holding... or using flash at the end of the exposure. It would also be nice to have the saucepan in focus? (ie not moving). 7', '2003-06-02 21:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(313298, 23220, 8530, '<td valign="top">Mmm. Yes, it evokes sound, but the picture itself does nothing for me. I''m not a gun fan or a sport shooting fan which probably explains the disinterest, and the homogenity of the green foreground and back doesn''t really capture my attention well either. Still, very definitely on topic.</td>', 'Mmm. Yes, it evokes sound, but the picture itself does nothing for me. I''m not a gun fan or a sport shooting fan which probably explains the disinterest, and the homogenity of the green foreground and back doesn''t really capture my attention well either. Still, very definitely on topic.', '2003-06-02 21:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(313302, 23165, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very nice indeed! I love the reflection, and the lighting that allowed it. You captured the textures well. Great angle and composition. The graininess around the neck works well. 8</td>', 'Very nice indeed! I love the reflection, and the lighting that allowed it. You captured the textures well. Great angle and composition. The graininess around the neck works well. 8', '2003-06-02 21:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(313303, 23494, 8530, '<td valign="top">I want to know what you (or your subject) is playing! (Maybe it''ll be in the notes.)<br/> <br/>I suppose I should not be surprised at the presence of several piano-related shots. I like the blur although the left hand maybe is a little too still by comparison. The angle is interesting, but something about the lighting seems off -- maybe a bit too bright on the moving fingers, or is that an artifact of the motion capture?</td>', 'I want to know what you (or your subject) is playing! (Maybe it''ll be in the notes.) I suppose I should not be surprised at the presence of several piano-related shots. I like the blur although the left hand maybe is a little too still by comparison. The angle is interesting, but something about the lighting seems off -- maybe a bit too bright on the moving fingers, or is that an artifact of the motion capture?', '2003-06-02 21:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(313306, 23219, 8530, '<td valign="top">Interesting I got two piano pictures in a row. Yes, it definitely hits the topic. I''m not sure the straight-on side view is the best, but it''s not bad, either. A bit more focus on the keys and less on the fingers maybe?</td>', 'Interesting I got two piano pictures in a row. Yes, it definitely hits the topic. I''m not sure the straight-on side view is the best, but it''s not bad, either. A bit more focus on the keys and less on the fingers maybe?', '2003-06-02 21:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(313307, 23543, 8530, '<td valign="top">Okay, that is just COOL, and I want to know how you did it.<br/> <br/>There''s a bit of a weird reflection that doesn''t look like it''s related to the headphones which is a bit distracting, but otherwise, I rather like this setup. Almost looks like an advertisment for the brand, in a very good commercial art way.<br/> <br/>Headphones and waves hit the topic; not a big grab me "I''M SOUND" but definitely without any second thought required.</td>', 'Okay, that is just COOL, and I want to know how you did it. There''s a bit of a weird reflection that doesn''t look like it''s related to the headphones which is a bit distracting, but otherwise, I rather like this setup. Almost looks like an advertisment for the brand, in a very good commercial art way. Headphones and waves hit the topic; not a big grab me "I''M SOUND" but definitely without any second thought required.', '2003-06-02 21:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(313312, 23525, 8530, '<td valign="top">Mmm... that''s less a drip than a splutter. I think either a small droplet of water or water hitting the sink rather than coming from the faucet would have worked better in terms of challenge relation. It''s an interesting capture, though, with the edge of the water visible as it is rather than a full stream. Nice lighting.</td>', 'Mmm... that''s less a drip than a splutter. I think either a small droplet of water or water hitting the sink rather than coming from the faucet would have worked better in terms of challenge relation. It''s an interesting capture, though, with the edge of the water visible as it is rather than a full stream. Nice lighting.', '2003-06-02 21:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(313314, 23151, 8530, '<td valign="top">Very bright, very symmetrical (but not so much so that it''s boring), good composition. However, whistles not being blown do less to evoke sound for me than something actively producing sound would, so while it does fit the challenge it doesn''t do so as intently as I prefer.</td>', 'Very bright, very symmetrical (but not so much so that it''s boring), good composition. However, whistles not being blown do less to evoke sound for me than something actively producing sound would, so while it does fit the challenge it doesn''t do so as intently as I prefer.', '2003-06-02 21:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(313316, 23476, 8530, '<td valign="top">Wow. Roller coasters scare the heck out of me, so I definitely can hear the screams. And the yellow against the nice, clear sky is a great contrast. Good composition; I almost feel I can see the coaster moving.</td>', 'Wow. Roller coasters scare the heck out of me, so I definitely can hear the screams. And the yellow against the nice, clear sky is a great contrast. Good composition; I almost feel I can see the coaster moving.', '2003-06-02 21:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(313320, 23328, 8530, '<td valign="top">The slight angle and the bright lighting help make this an interesting shot even though the topic is obviously not totally original. The position of fingers helps with the active ''sound'' presentation, too. Kinda looks like my Casio (hey, give that back!).</td>', 'The slight angle and the bright lighting help make this an interesting shot even though the topic is obviously not totally original. The position of fingers helps with the active ''sound'' presentation, too. Kinda looks like my Casio (hey, give that back!).', '2003-06-02 21:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(313324, 23197, 8530, '<td valign="top">Mmm. Mmm. Mmm. This is the sound of indecision.<br/> <br/>The dancers caught my eye first, and while that implies sound to some extent, it doesn''t initially jump out as a sound photo. A closer focus on the percussionists might have helped with this. I also am not sure I like teh way the bottom dancer is cut off; a different angle might have helped with the challenge-meeting aspect in general.<br/> <br/>That having been said, aside from not caring for the dancer position entirely, I think this is a fairly good action shot.</td>', 'Mmm. Mmm. Mmm. This is the sound of indecision. The dancers caught my eye first, and while that implies sound to some extent, it doesn''t initially jump out as a sound photo. A closer focus on the percussionists might have helped with this. I also am not sure I like teh way the bottom dancer is cut off; a different angle might have helped with the challenge-meeting aspect in general. That having been said, aside from not caring for the dancer position entirely, I think this is a fairly good action shot.', '2003-06-02 21:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(313327, 23539, 8530, '<td valign="top">Wow, another phonograph, and this time REALLY a phonograph, old-style. I have a soft place in my heart for vinyl, being I still have an extensive collection of it, so it very strongly evokes ''sound'' for me. I like the toning on it, giving it that nice old-photo feel, which alas goes well with the subject.</td>', 'Wow, another phonograph, and this time REALLY a phonograph, old-style. I have a soft place in my heart for vinyl, being I still have an extensive collection of it, so it very strongly evokes ''sound'' for me. I like the toning on it, giving it that nice old-photo feel, which alas goes well with the subject.', '2003-06-02 21:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(313328, 23425, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture (again...).  The eyes, in particular, are just right.  I like the way the fingers curve and frame the face.  I must say though, I get the feeling of "relief from sound" (as when my children put on their headphones) rather than "sound", or music.  ~10</td>', 'Beautiful picture (again...).  The eyes, in particular, are just right.  I like the way the fingers curve and frame the face.  I must say though, I get the feeling of "relief from sound" (as when my children put on their headphones) rather than "sound", or music.  ~10', '2003-06-02 21:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(313331, 23521, 8530, '<td valign="top">Good drum capture. Slightly strange to see all those people with no heads (you could probably make a horror story out of that if you were so inclined (but that''s probably just the sleep dep talking)), but the focus should be on the drums, so it makes sense. Evokes the challenge well. It''s maybe a little too busy, but I''m not sure what you could have done to lessen that impression.</td>', 'Good drum capture. Slightly strange to see all those people with no heads (you could probably make a horror story out of that if you were so inclined (but that''s probably just the sleep dep talking)), but the focus should be on the drums, so it makes sense. Evokes the challenge well. It''s maybe a little too busy, but I''m not sure what you could have done to lessen that impression.', '2003-06-02 21:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(313332, 23494, 5112, '<td valign="top">IMO, the best of the piano pictures entered to this challenge.  I love the way the right hand looks transparent.</td>', 'IMO, the best of the piano pictures entered to this challenge.  I love the way the right hand looks transparent.', '2003-06-02 21:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(313334, 23448, 8530, '<td valign="top">Hmm, even with the title I''m not sure I understand what this is supposed to be -- ice cracking is my best guess, in which case it''s on topic, but as it''s somewhat unclear and a little abstract it''s hard to get a good feel for it.</td>', 'Hmm, even with the title I''m not sure I understand what this is supposed to be -- ice cracking is my best guess, in which case it''s on topic, but as it''s somewhat unclear and a little abstract it''s hard to get a good feel for it.', '2003-06-02 21:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
