(313509, 23378, 4494, '<td valign="top">You get a 10 to offset the American hating 1''s you''ll get.  Great job!</td>', 'You get a 10 to offset the American hating 1''s you''ll get.  Great job!', '2003-06-03 01:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(313510, 23496, 2000, '<td valign="top">I have a painting like this photograph.  The water rushing by over the rocks is a very nice visual of this sound.  The motion is captured very well, down to the stationary rock in the lower center.  8 if I was voting.</td>', 'I have a painting like this photograph.  The water rushing by over the rocks is a very nice visual of this sound.  The motion is captured very well, down to the stationary rock in the lower center.  8 if I was voting.', '2003-06-03 01:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(313512, 23513, 4494, '<td valign="top">Would be better without the odd border.  Love it tho. :)  Lose the border for sure.</td>', 'Would be better without the odd border.  Love it tho. :)  Lose the border for sure.', '2003-06-03 01:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(313513, 23453, 2000, '<td valign="top">The title of "AFLAC" might also have worked, except for the overseas folks.  This duck was very kind to allow you such a photograph - I didn''t know ducks had tongues. 8-9 if voting.</td>', 'The title of "AFLAC" might also have worked, except for the overseas folks.  This duck was very kind to allow you such a photograph - I didn''t know ducks had tongues. 8-9 if voting.', '2003-06-03 01:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(313514, 22936, 4494, '<td valign="top">Wow, you spelled "portable" wrong.  LOL, that''s really bad.</td>', 'Wow, you spelled "portable" wrong.  LOL, that''s really bad.', '2003-06-03 01:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(313515, 23472, 4494, '<td valign="top">What''s this?</td>', 'What''s this?', '2003-06-03 01:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(313516, 23528, 2000, '<td valign="top">Not to be too picky here, but that''s a plastic dart.  I don''t know that this would actually pop the balloon, or just bounce off.  That said, it''s a good idea - but a metal dart (with scotch tape or liquid skin over the hole) might make the point a bit better.  6-7 if I was voting.</td>', 'Not to be too picky here, but that''s a plastic dart.  I don''t know that this would actually pop the balloon, or just bounce off.  That said, it''s a good idea - but a metal dart (with scotch tape or liquid skin over the hole) might make the point a bit better.  6-7 if I was voting.', '2003-06-03 01:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(313517, 23544, 8530, '<td valign="top">It''s a pity someone did almost this same shot. I opined there that a different background or a brass tone to the clock would have made the ringing more obvious, but you have a similar problem -- darker background for this one might have made it stand out more. Anyhow, it IS on topic, and it''s a nice shot, very clean, but the clapper is a little TOO blurry -- maybe a slightly shorter exposure time?</td>', 'It''s a pity someone did almost this same shot. I opined there that a different background or a brass tone to the clock would have made the ringing more obvious, but you have a similar problem -- darker background for this one might have made it stand out more. Anyhow, it IS on topic, and it''s a nice shot, very clean, but the clapper is a little TOO blurry -- maybe a slightly shorter exposure time?', '2003-06-03 01:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(313518, 23401, 8530, '<td valign="top">Huh, neat shot, with smoke coming through (I assume smoke, seems too dense for steam), and with a nice tonal quality. A little abstract on the topic side but I can see a clear connection to the topic.</td>', 'Huh, neat shot, with smoke coming through (I assume smoke, seems too dense for steam), and with a nice tonal quality. A little abstract on the topic side but I can see a clear connection to the topic.', '2003-06-03 01:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(313520, 23425, 8530, '<td valign="top">While it conveys the topic well, the expression looks a little on the bored side for what you were trying to convey -- I surmise maybe lots of pictures were taken before hitting on one that worked. I do very much like the angle and the lighting on this, a very visually interesting photograh.</td>', 'While it conveys the topic well, the expression looks a little on the bored side for what you were trying to convey -- I surmise maybe lots of pictures were taken before hitting on one that worked. I do very much like the angle and the lighting on this, a very visually interesting photograh.', '2003-06-03 01:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(313522, 23379, 8530, '<td valign="top">Oh, I like this idea! It makes me want to know what was said to provoke the reaction, and the connection to the challenge topic is quite clear. The man''s hair is a little distracting at that angle but the girl is quite well framed.</td>', 'Oh, I like this idea! It makes me want to know what was said to provoke the reaction, and the connection to the challenge topic is quite clear. The man''s hair is a little distracting at that angle but the girl is quite well framed.', '2003-06-03 01:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(313523, 22947, 6600, '<td valign="top">Excellent subject with great composition, color, and focus.  Super ''double-digit'' job!</td>', 'Excellent subject with great composition, color, and focus.  Super ''double-digit'' job!', '2003-06-03 01:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(313524, 23500, 8530, '<td valign="top">Poor rusty bike. Very sound (heh, er, okay, I admit, pun intended) subject choice. The lighting is a little bright as the reflection on the muffler (er, that IS a muffler, right? auto shop was a long time ago) stands out a bit much against the rest.</td>', 'Poor rusty bike. Very sound (heh, er, okay, I admit, pun intended) subject choice. The lighting is a little bright as the reflection on the muffler (er, that IS a muffler, right? auto shop was a long time ago) stands out a bit much against the rest.', '2003-06-03 01:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(313525, 23523, 6600, '<td valign="top">Kind of neat exposure and idea.  Nice contrast and color (love the shadows).  Super job!</td>', 'Kind of neat exposure and idea.  Nice contrast and color (love the shadows).  Super job!', '2003-06-03 01:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(313526, 23433, 8530, '<td valign="top">This shot seems somewhat busy, although I suppose it would stand reasonably well as a photojournalism shot. Definitely connection to the challenge topic.</td>', 'This shot seems somewhat busy, although I suppose it would stand reasonably well as a photojournalism shot. Definitely connection to the challenge topic.', '2003-06-03 01:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(313528, 23372, 8530, '<td valign="top">*wince* Ack. Kids screeching. Yes, yes, very obvious connection to the topic. Very candid snapshot style, not my favorite subject in general but I have no technical complaints.</td>', '*wince* Ack. Kids screeching. Yes, yes, very obvious connection to the topic. Very candid snapshot style, not my favorite subject in general but I have no technical complaints.', '2003-06-03 01:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(313530, 23517, 8530, '<td valign="top">Hmm... the disconnected headphones don''t do much for me in terms of strength of topic connection, which is not to say it''s off-topic. Visually it''s a fairly good shot, a commercial art feel to it, although I think I would have preferred it a bit crisper.</td>', 'Hmm... the disconnected headphones don''t do much for me in terms of strength of topic connection, which is not to say it''s off-topic. Visually it''s a fairly good shot, a commercial art feel to it, although I think I would have preferred it a bit crisper.', '2003-06-03 01:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(313531, 23517, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nice looking headphoes (nice product shot).  Good job!</td>', 'Nice looking headphoes (nice product shot).  Good job!', '2003-06-03 01:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(313532, 23551, 8530, '<td valign="top">Okay, that effect is just neat, although I think the lighting level probably should have been brought down a bit or contrast reduced slightly. I see the connection to the topic, and I do like the shadow and ripple shadow -- in fact, if it weren''t for needing the establishing tuning fork shot for the topic connection, I''d like it without that visible.<br/> <br/>I am now driving myself nuts trying to figure out what the song is. I hope you reveal this later!</td>', 'Okay, that effect is just neat, although I think the lighting level probably should have been brought down a bit or contrast reduced slightly. I see the connection to the topic, and I do like the shadow and ripple shadow -- in fact, if it weren''t for needing the establishing tuning fork shot for the topic connection, I''d like it without that visible. I am now driving myself nuts trying to figure out what the song is. I hope you reveal this later!', '2003-06-03 01:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(313533, 23526, 7392, '<td valign="top">awesome photo!  I can hear that.</td>', 'awesome photo!  I can hear that.', '2003-06-03 01:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(313536, 23549, 7392, '<td valign="top">POP!  another awesome photo.  No.2 on my list.</td>', 'POP!  another awesome photo.  No.2 on my list.', '2003-06-03 01:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(313537, 22876, 7392, '<td valign="top">Very cool!  my 3rd favorite.</td>', 'Very cool!  my 3rd favorite.', '2003-06-03 01:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(313545, 22855, 7350, '<td valign="top">I think the composition here is perfect.  I wouldn''t change a thing.  10.</td>', 'I think the composition here is perfect.  I wouldn''t change a thing.  10.', '2003-06-03 02:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(313546, 23525, 7350, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic capture.  I wonder if it is ice or something.  Doesn''t really look like a "Drip drip drip..." like the title suggests.  More of a gush!  10 from me.</td>', 'This is a fantastic capture.  I wonder if it is ice or something.  Doesn''t really look like a "Drip drip drip..." like the title suggests.  More of a gush!  10 from me.', '2003-06-03 02:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(313547, 23549, 8701, '<td valign="top">This is really cool, howd you take it from so close? 9</td>', 'This is really cool, howd you take it from so close? 9', '2003-06-03 02:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(313548, 23425, 8701, '<td valign="top">I like this one alot, i cant put my finger on exactly why, but this is really good. 9<br/></td>', 'I like this one alot, i cant put my finger on exactly why, but this is really good. 9', '2003-06-03 02:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(313549, 23379, 8701, '<td valign="top">Just looking at this makes me smile, very genuine, 10</td>', 'Just looking at this makes me smile, very genuine, 10', '2003-06-03 02:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(313550, 22979, 6893, '<td valign="top">To bad you are wasting your creative beauty and energy on these photographic experts.</td>', 'To bad you are wasting your creative beauty and energy on these photographic experts.', '2003-06-03 02:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(313562, 22876, 7339, '<td valign="top">Perfect couldnt be better!!!  Adding it to favorites as I write this.</td>', 'Perfect couldnt be better!!!  Adding it to favorites as I write this.', '2003-06-03 03:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(313670, 23517, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting shot... i like the blue/yellow tones of the lighting... i think this would make a good product photo if there was a bit more highlight on the brand name / logo on the lower left... I also feel that the composition may be a little too tight at the top... maybe just a bit of extra breathing room up there would be good also :)</td>', 'interesting shot... i like the blue/yellow tones of the lighting... i think this would make a good product photo if there was a bit more highlight on the brand name / logo on the lower left... I also feel that the composition may be a little too tight at the top... maybe just a bit of extra breathing room up there would be good also :)', '2003-06-03 09:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(313679, 23394, 6600, '<td valign="top">Very nice job!  Conveys the title well.  Nice color and exposure (lighting is nice).</td>', 'Very nice job!  Conveys the title well.  Nice color and exposure (lighting is nice).', '2003-06-03 09:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(313682, 23220, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nice color, composition, with a cool view of smoke and shells.  Critique: I would have used a lower f-stop to blur the background (maybe F4 or lower).</td>', 'Nice color, composition, with a cool view of smoke and shells.  Critique: I would have used a lower f-stop to blur the background (maybe F4 or lower).', '2003-06-03 09:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(313688, 23372, 2764, '<td valign="top">wish their faces were turned towards the camera</td>', 'wish their faces were turned towards the camera', '2003-06-03 10:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(313708, 23337, 2764, '<td valign="top">Lots of problems here - I''ll just mention one - camera shake.  You don''t have enough light for a hand held shot here.  If you had put the camera on a trii pod or even balanced it on a chir or a beanie baby the keys would have been in sharp focus and then the blurred hand would have been effective.</td>', 'Lots of problems here - I''ll just mention one - camera shake.  You don''t have enough light for a hand held shot here.  If you had put the camera on a trii pod or even balanced it on a chir or a beanie baby the keys would have been in sharp focus and then the blurred hand would have been effective.', '2003-06-03 10:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(313709, 23507, 2764, '<td valign="top">People like to "read" a photo from left to right.  This feels backwards, even though i isn''t.  Try flipping it to see if it looks better.</td>', 'People like to "read" a photo from left to right.  This feels backwards, even though i isn''t.  Try flipping it to see if it looks better.', '2003-06-03 10:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(313734, 23421, 5112, '<td valign="top">It probably isn\''t, but this shot reminds me of Chicago\''s lake shore.  It\''s really good how you caught the wave splash, and I can hear the water, wind, and the gulls.  The border bothers me a bit, and there\''s a slight discolouration right around the edge of the picture and by the horizon.  The picture almost looks like it might have been sharpened a bit too much.  Good job.  ~7</td>', 'It probably isn\''t, but this shot reminds me of Chicago\''s lake shore.  It\''s really good how you caught the wave splash, and I can hear the water, wind, and the gulls.  The border bothers me a bit, and there\''s a slight discolouration right around the edge of the picture and by the horizon.  The picture almost looks like it might have been sharpened a bit too much.  Good job.  ~7', '2003-06-03 11:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(313735, 23401, 5112, '<td valign="top">Mozart, eh?  One of my favourite operas (Die Zauberfloete).  Anyway.  Good picture, great idea.  ~8</td>', 'Mozart, eh?  One of my favourite operas (Die Zauberfloete).  Anyway.  Good picture, great idea.  ~8', '2003-06-03 11:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
