(316068, 23197, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good subject. Would like to have seen a tighter shot on the drummer. All the people standing around lower the energy.  Maybe slow down the shutter speed to to get more motion.</td>', 'Good subject. Would like to have seen a tighter shot on the drummer. All the people standing around lower the energy.  Maybe slow down the shutter speed to to get more motion.', '2003-06-05 00:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(316101, 23539, 6325, '<td valign="top">I like this. Good composition and tone. I can hear the scratchy sound.</td>', 'I like this. Good composition and tone. I can hear the scratchy sound.', '2003-06-05 01:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(316103, 23516, 6325, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect here. The bacon seems to float.  I can hear it and smell it. This could have worked in the Liquid challenge also.</td>', 'Interesting effect here. The bacon seems to float.  I can hear it and smell it. This could have worked in the Liquid challenge also.', '2003-06-05 01:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(316106, 23407, 6325, '<td valign="top">Nice, clean shot. I can hear it.</td>', 'Nice, clean shot. I can hear it.', '2003-06-05 01:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(316111, 23524, 6325, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect with the lighting.</td>', 'Interesting effect with the lighting.', '2003-06-05 01:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(316114, 23357, 6325, '<td valign="top">Looks peaceful. The plop of the cork hitting the water would have been cool.</td>', 'Looks peaceful. The plop of the cork hitting the water would have been cool.', '2003-06-05 01:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(316116, 23386, 6325, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Well lighted and exposed. A little static to really get the point across, but a good shot.</td>', 'Nice composition. Well lighted and exposed. A little static to really get the point across, but a good shot.', '2003-06-05 01:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(316129, 23527, 6325, '<td valign="top">Nice tones. Good subject. Showing some motion would have made a stronger shot. A slower shutter speed might work.</td>', 'Nice tones. Good subject. Showing some motion would have made a stronger shot. A slower shutter speed might work.', '2003-06-05 01:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(316131, 22855, 6325, '<td valign="top">Like the exposure and the composition. Captures the challenge.</td>', 'Like the exposure and the composition. Captures the challenge.', '2003-06-05 01:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(316264, 23299, 8701, '<td valign="top">The colors are nice although i dont understand the picture too much but that doesnt mean its bad, 6</td>', 'The colors are nice although i dont understand the picture too much but that doesnt mean its bad, 6', '2003-06-05 05:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(316265, 23523, 8701, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is really cool and original, 8</td>', 'Wow, this is really cool and original, 8', '2003-06-05 05:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(316266, 23335, 8701, '<td valign="top">Really nice, it fits the challenge well and the shape of the colors is really intriuging, 9</td>', 'Really nice, it fits the challenge well and the shape of the colors is really intriuging, 9', '2003-06-05 05:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(316292, 22876, 9174, '<td valign="top">Not very original idea yet excellent realisation!</td>', 'Not very original idea yet excellent realisation!', '2003-06-05 08:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(316333, 23472, 8060, '<td valign="top">I like the blurred/saturated effect, not really sure about the title?</td>', 'I like the blurred/saturated effect, not really sure about the title?', '2003-06-05 09:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(316341, 23335, 6740, '<td valign="top">I had an idea along the same line but I love yours! How did you protect your camera against a premature explosion?  10</td>', 'I had an idea along the same line but I love yours! How did you protect your camera against a premature explosion?  10', '2003-06-05 09:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(316342, 23178, 6740, '<td valign="top">Love this photo.Takes me back to my younger days when I was working on my grandpa''s farm. It was work back then, but I miss it now. Thanks for the memories!<br/>10</td>', 'Love this photo.Takes me back to my younger days when I was working on my grandpa''s farm. It was work back then, but I miss it now. Thanks for the memories!10', '2003-06-05 09:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(316366, 23537, 7800, '<td valign="top">Great picture! I can hear the splash.</td>', 'Great picture! I can hear the splash.', '2003-06-05 10:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(316367, 23528, 7800, '<td valign="top">Awesome color. Great tricky shot. Good job.</td>', 'Awesome color. Great tricky shot. Good job.', '2003-06-05 10:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(316368, 23529, 7800, '<td valign="top">I wonder if she''d cupped her hands around her mouth if it would have been even more apparant that she''s screaming. Neat shot though.</td>', 'I wonder if she''d cupped her hands around her mouth if it would have been even more apparant that she''s screaming. Neat shot though.', '2003-06-05 10:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(316369, 23407, 7800, '<td valign="top">Great idea! I would have liked to have seen this shot w/o the background distractions; against a solid color.</td>', 'Great idea! I would have liked to have seen this shot w/o the background distractions; against a solid color.', '2003-06-05 10:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(316371, 23425, 7800, '<td valign="top">I think an animated expression might have conveyed listening to loud music rather than a passive one. Great picture though, what a cute kid!</td>', 'I think an animated expression might have conveyed listening to loud music rather than a passive one. Great picture though, what a cute kid!', '2003-06-05 10:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(316379, 23165, 326, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle and nice tones!</td>', 'Interesting angle and nice tones!', '2003-06-05 10:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(316404, 23335, 1202, '<td valign="top">This is just a great shot, exposure, timing, composition. 10</td>', 'This is just a great shot, exposure, timing, composition. 10', '2003-06-05 11:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(316476, 23520, 4811, '<td valign="top">Totally washed out highlights... but it works in this photo! When my highlights are blown in my entries,  I get picked apart for it... hope it doesn''t happen to you - this is a really unique image that''s interestingly composed and nicely conveys the sound of the waves.</td>', 'Totally washed out highlights... but it works in this photo! When my highlights are blown in my entries,  I get picked apart for it... hope it doesn''t happen to you - this is a really unique image that''s interestingly composed and nicely conveys the sound of the waves.', '2003-06-05 12:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(316499, 23425, 4811, '<td valign="top">Great expression captured! Contrast is just a little flat and needs minor adjusting (at least on my monitor)... levels adjustment?</td>', 'Great expression captured! Contrast is just a little flat and needs minor adjusting (at least on my monitor)... levels adjustment?', '2003-06-05 12:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(316507, 23379, 9014, '<td valign="top">This is so playful and just by looking at the photo I hear the whispers and giggles in my head. I think it''s a great depiction of sound!</td>', 'This is so playful and just by looking at the photo I hear the whispers and giggles in my head. I think it''s a great depiction of sound!', '2003-06-05 12:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(316513, 23394, 9014, '<td valign="top">This is simply beautiful. I bet it would look incredible in black and white! I swear I can hear the baby''s heart beat!</td>', 'This is simply beautiful. I bet it would look incredible in black and white! I swear I can hear the baby''s heart beat!', '2003-06-05 12:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(316519, 23525, 9014, '<td valign="top">Screw the sound...how in the hell did you capture this? That is a perfect shot and it''s amazing that you captured the water just before it hit the sink!  You can''t see me but I''m bowing down to you, lol. I''ve been trying to master this for a minute and my photos never come out like this! I love it!</td>', 'Screw the sound...how in the hell did you capture this? That is a perfect shot and it''s amazing that you captured the water just before it hit the sink!  You can''t see me but I''m bowing down to you, lol. I''ve been trying to master this for a minute and my photos never come out like this! I love it!', '2003-06-05 12:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(316585, 23314, 7339, '<td valign="top">I really like this image. The croping, color and frame are excellent. I gave it a 9</td>', 'I really like this image. The croping, color and frame are excellent. I gave it a 9', '2003-06-05 12:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(316589, 23549, 7339, '<td valign="top">This is an all to familar sound. I heard it the second I saw the photo. Great job. I gave it an 8</td>', 'This is an all to familar sound. I heard it the second I saw the photo. Great job. I gave it an 8', '2003-06-05 12:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(316590, 22971, 7339, '<td valign="top">cool, at least im not the only person that does this. My wife goes nuts when I do this at dinner lol I really like the color and the idea. It really shows sound to me. Gave it an 8</td>', 'cool, at least im not the only person that does this. My wife goes nuts when I do this at dinner lol I really like the color and the idea. It really shows sound to me. Gave it an 8', '2003-06-05 12:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(316593, 22947, 7339, '<td valign="top">I really really like this shot. I love old machines (i have an very old antique typewriter and a few others) so appreciate this shot. The lighting and composure are perfect.  I gave it an 8</td>', 'I really really like this shot. I love old machines (i have an very old antique typewriter and a few others) so appreciate this shot. The lighting and composure are perfect.  I gave it an 8', '2003-06-05 13:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(316595, 23401, 7339, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like the use of the smoke. Lighting is cool too. 8 from me.</td>', 'Very nice. I like the use of the smoke. Lighting is cool too. 8 from me.', '2003-06-05 13:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(316616, 23463, 1143, '<td valign="top">what caused the grey circles in the sky? very lovely scene</td>', 'what caused the grey circles in the sky? very lovely scene', '2003-06-05 13:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(316688, 23345, 6597, '<td valign="top">I like the texture in this</td>', 'I like the texture in this', '2003-06-05 13:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(316692, 23421, 6597, '<td valign="top">good color</td>', 'good color', '2003-06-05 13:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(316699, 23528, 6597, '<td valign="top">Wow that does make a soundgood color contrast</td>', 'Wow that does make a soundgood color contrast', '2003-06-05 13:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(316903, 22979, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but it doesn''t really make me "hear" anything.  Did you use flash?  It might have been better to use other lighting.</td>', 'Nice idea, but it doesn''t really make me "hear" anything.  Did you use flash?  It might have been better to use other lighting.', '2003-06-05 15:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(316907, 23518, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  I asked my husband (who plays classical guitar) and he tells me the fingers are in the right position for the beginning of Tarrega''s piece (I hope he''s right :).  Who is the guitarrist?  I really like this picture, it''s one of my two 10s this week.</td>', 'Good shot.  I asked my husband (who plays classical guitar) and he tells me the fingers are in the right position for the beginning of Tarrega''s piece (I hope he''s right :).  Who is the guitarrist?  I really like this picture, it''s one of my two 10s this week.', '2003-06-05 15:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(316911, 23529, 5112, '<td valign="top">Great use of the "from above" setup.</td>', 'Great use of the "from above" setup.', '2003-06-05 15:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(316913, 23054, 5112, '<td valign="top">It would have been nice if you could have taken a picture of the guitar without showing the sticker inside.  Also, I think the light is a bit harsh (is it flash?).  Good try though - guitars are beautiful to photograph.</td>', 'It would have been nice if you could have taken a picture of the guitar without showing the sticker inside.  Also, I think the light is a bit harsh (is it flash?).  Good try though - guitars are beautiful to photograph.', '2003-06-05 15:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(316919, 23314, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good idea, very original. The delayed shutter speed effect comes over very well - 9.</td>', 'Good idea, very original. The delayed shutter speed effect comes over very well - 9.', '2003-06-05 15:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(316924, 23425, 5728, '<td valign="top">Excellent B&amp;W portrait! - 10.</td>', 'Excellent B&W portrait! - 10.', '2003-06-05 15:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(316930, 23525, 7190, '<td valign="top">Kind of a cool shot  anticipation of the splash</td>', 'Kind of a cool shot  anticipation of the splash', '2003-06-05 16:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(317079, 23314, 5391, '<td valign="top">I love the way you captured this.  It''s perfect in every respect.  Congrats on an awesome shot.</td>', 'I love the way you captured this.  It''s perfect in every respect.  Congrats on an awesome shot.', '2003-06-05 17:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(317081, 23529, 5391, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Perfect composition and it captures the challenge so well!</td>', 'Great shot!  Perfect composition and it captures the challenge so well!', '2003-06-05 17:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(317189, 23529, 5728, '<td valign="top">Excellent, she is gorgeous! I do know this face don''t I? - 10, Gary.</td>', 'Excellent, she is gorgeous! I do know this face don''t I? - 10, Gary.', '2003-06-05 19:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(317203, 23379, 5475, '<td valign="top">I''m pressed for time and don''t have time to make comments this week, but I had to leave one for this image.  This is one of the best examples I''ve seen in a long time of capturing emotion and interaction with a photograph.  The black and white works great...  I cant find anything to improve, other than the back of her hand being a little blown out, but that''s Ok.  I give it a 10 and I hope to see this image win the challenge!!<br/> <br/>JD Anderson</td>', 'I''m pressed for time and don''t have time to make comments this week, but I had to leave one for this image.  This is one of the best examples I''ve seen in a long time of capturing emotion and interaction with a photograph.  The black and white works great...  I cant find anything to improve, other than the back of her hand being a little blown out, but that''s Ok.  I give it a 10 and I hope to see this image win the challenge!! JD Anderson', '2003-06-05 19:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(317279, 23394, 2716, '<td valign="top">Great shot :)  I can almost hear the little heart beat.  Wonderful skin tones.  Good luck.  Jacko.  10</td>', 'Great shot :)  I can almost hear the little heart beat.  Wonderful skin tones.  Good luck.  Jacko.  10', '2003-06-05 20:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(317320, 23314, 6600, '<td valign="top">I like the color tone &amp; composition. Good subject - fits the challenge well - Well titled (like the double exposed second hand).</td>', 'I like the color tone & composition. Good subject - fits the challenge well - Well titled (like the double exposed second hand).', '2003-06-05 22:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(317322, 23379, 6600, '<td valign="top">Simply a teriffic capture!  I can almost hear the giddy exchange as I am typing.  Great expressions, good exposure, and nicely cropped.  Super job!</td>', 'Simply a teriffic capture!  I can almost hear the giddy exchange as I am typing.  Great expressions, good exposure, and nicely cropped.  Super job!', '2003-06-05 22:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(317326, 23530, 6600, '<td valign="top">I know how noisy these critters can be (my local zoo has some).  Your choice of composition works well.  (Can you select white balance? The color seems to be a bit off..... on my monitor.)</td>', 'I know how noisy these critters can be (my local zoo has some).  Your choice of composition works well.  (Can you select white balance? The color seems to be a bit off..... on my monitor.)', '2003-06-05 22:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(317333, 22855, 6600, '<td valign="top">Did you intentionally blow out this shot?  I am guessing you did...  kind of a neat effect, I like it.  Nice composition!  Great job!  I might have dubbed it.... White Noise</td>', 'Did you intentionally blow out this shot?  I am guessing you did...  kind of a neat effect, I like it.  Nice composition!  Great job!  I might have dubbed it.... White Noise', '2003-06-05 22:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(317376, 23394, 772, '<td valign="top">best of show = 10 - btw - i bet this would make a phenomenal black and white :)</td>', 'best of show = 10 - btw - i bet this would make a phenomenal black and white :)', '2003-06-06 00:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(317509, 23394, 4400, '<td valign="top">This is just sweet photo very fine 10 pt</td>', 'This is just sweet photo very fine 10 pt', '2003-06-06 07:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
