(317682, 23168, 7339, '<td valign="top">I think this image had good color and good compositon but was lost due to the lack of focus. If it was sharp I would have giving it a 6 but instead gave it a 3 do to lack of sharpness.</td>', 'I think this image had good color and good compositon but was lost due to the lack of focus. If it was sharp I would have giving it a 6 but instead gave it a 3 do to lack of sharpness.', '2003-06-06 11:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(317683, 23472, 7339, '<td valign="top">I looked up on google what manitoba was and only found natural gas and a moose. Since im not sure if thats correct and dont see in this photo what excatly it is, im lost. I do like the colors of her hair and the green on the opposite side but dont get a true feeling of sound. Sorry but I gave it a 4 based on those reasons.</td>', 'I looked up on google what manitoba was and only found natural gas and a moose. Since im not sure if thats correct and dont see in this photo what excatly it is, im lost. I do like the colors of her hair and the green on the opposite side but dont get a true feeling of sound. Sorry but I gave it a 4 based on those reasons.', '2003-06-06 11:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(317686, 23488, 7339, '<td valign="top">Not a bad image overall. The sky and shirts are blown out. If you had metered on the sky that may have helped bring back the highlights but you may have lost the players inside so I dont know. <br/> <br/>A little bit busy as I find my eyes are drawn to the girl on the right then the crane in the blown out left side of the pic and then to the people sitting on the bench. Finally I noticed the players. Perhaps it would have been a stronger image if you got lower to the ground and shot thru the shoulders of the audience. I gave it a 4.<br/></td>', 'Not a bad image overall. The sky and shirts are blown out. If you had metered on the sky that may have helped bring back the highlights but you may have lost the players inside so I dont know.  A little bit busy as I find my eyes are drawn to the girl on the right then the crane in the blown out left side of the pic and then to the people sitting on the bench. Finally I noticed the players. Perhaps it would have been a stronger image if you got lower to the ground and shot thru the shoulders of the audience. I gave it a 4.', '2003-06-06 11:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(317688, 23514, 7339, '<td valign="top">While this picture does bring, at least to this third shifter, the feeling of sound, I dont really find it appealing. Sorry just my opinion. I gave it a 4</td>', 'While this picture does bring, at least to this third shifter, the feeling of sound, I dont really find it appealing. Sorry just my opinion. I gave it a 4', '2003-06-06 11:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(317691, 22855, 7628, '<td valign="top">The high key (light) emphasizes the noise level here.  The hat, necklace, and bracelet are good anchors - give your eyes some guidance where they might otherwise get lost in all that white.  I like the crop too - balance between the loud sound and wanting to block it out.  Nice all around! 9</td>', 'The high key (light) emphasizes the noise level here.  The hat, necklace, and bracelet are good anchors - give your eyes some guidance where they might otherwise get lost in all that white.  I like the crop too - balance between the loud sound and wanting to block it out.  Nice all around! 9', '2003-06-06 11:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(317694, 23219, 7628, '<td valign="top">Piano sound is one of my favorites.  Here I like the highlight on the lot of the black keys contrasting with the shadow of their sides.  The fingers playing are good with the theme - howver I think the blurry hand inthe background distracts from the forground one and we canm;t see that it is playing at all.  I''d have a bettwer view of both hands or just the one hand.  The white space on the left and the blurred part of the piano on the left also pull the eye away from the subject.  You could crop in closer, or recompose the subject by photgraphing over the player''s shoulder and have the keyboard and hands fill the frame.</td>', 'Piano sound is one of my favorites.  Here I like the highlight on the lot of the black keys contrasting with the shadow of their sides.  The fingers playing are good with the theme - howver I think the blurry hand inthe background distracts from the forground one and we canm;t see that it is playing at all.  I''d have a bettwer view of both hands or just the one hand.  The white space on the left and the blurred part of the piano on the left also pull the eye away from the subject.  You could crop in closer, or recompose the subject by photgraphing over the player''s shoulder and have the keyboard and hands fill the frame.', '2003-06-06 11:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(317700, 23130, 7628, '<td valign="top">An equalizer is indicative of sound.  So that much fits the challenge.  Composition is nicely balances within the frame (but then again it *is* rectangular to start).  The subject is unfortunately flat and not very interesting.</td>', 'An equalizer is indicative of sound.  So that much fits the challenge.  Composition is nicely balances within the frame (but then again it *is* rectangular to start).  The subject is unfortunately flat and not very interesting.', '2003-06-06 11:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(317704, 23547, 7628, '<td valign="top">yes! this looks loud indeed.  I like the crop in that it focuses the attention on the mouth and the cupped hands and makes it easy to "hear" the yell.  I like the space of the right for the sound to fill.  Wish we could either see more of the nose or not see it at all. The light on the hand looks very nice - but I wish it were illuminating the mouth - that would "tell the story" better.  The photo is not after all of a hand, nut of the sound coming out of the mouth.</td>', 'yes! this looks loud indeed.  I like the crop in that it focuses the attention on the mouth and the cupped hands and makes it easy to "hear" the yell.  I like the space of the right for the sound to fill.  Wish we could either see more of the nose or not see it at all. The light on the hand looks very nice - but I wish it were illuminating the mouth - that would "tell the story" better.  The photo is not after all of a hand, nut of the sound coming out of the mouth.', '2003-06-06 11:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(317712, 23353, 7628, '<td valign="top">I thought of doing wind chimes too -you are right they make such "gentle tones."  While I know that a tree is the appropriate place for the chimes, I find the background a bit distracting.  maybe if you''d had an even smaller DOF or composed the shot with less big branches in the background?  I like the way the feathery green of the leaves reminds me of the sounds of the chimes.  The shadow that falls across the chimes is also distracting.  I do like how the wind-catching part seems to be floating rather than hanging, it give a nice feel for the subject.</td>', 'I thought of doing wind chimes too -you are right they make such "gentle tones."  While I know that a tree is the appropriate place for the chimes, I find the background a bit distracting.  maybe if you''d had an even smaller DOF or composed the shot with less big branches in the background?  I like the way the feathery green of the leaves reminds me of the sounds of the chimes.  The shadow that falls across the chimes is also distracting.  I do like how the wind-catching part seems to be floating rather than hanging, it give a nice feel for the subject.', '2003-06-06 12:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(317718, 23337, 7628, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle.  The piano keys hanging there like the moon in the sky...I''m not sure it works for me.  The dark cool lighting  and lack of focus also makes me think of the moon, but even the moon cuold be brighter and provide more distinction to what it shines on.  The blur of the fingers in motion riminds you of how music moves.  However the fingers don''t look so recognizable - perhaps a little more light or inclusion of more than 3 fingers would help.  The crop on the keyboard is also awkward - none of the lines matching up with the frame of the picture everything is a jumble of angles.  You have a lot of nice ideas it just doesn''t come together for me.</td>', 'Interesting angle.  The piano keys hanging there like the moon in the sky...I''m not sure it works for me.  The dark cool lighting  and lack of focus also makes me think of the moon, but even the moon cuold be brighter and provide more distinction to what it shines on.  The blur of the fingers in motion riminds you of how music moves.  However the fingers don''t look so recognizable - perhaps a little more light or inclusion of more than 3 fingers would help.  The crop on the keyboard is also awkward - none of the lines matching up with the frame of the picture everything is a jumble of angles.  You have a lot of nice ideas it just doesn''t come together for me.', '2003-06-06 12:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(317721, 23156, 7628, '<td valign="top">Vibrating string - a good visual reminder of sound.  Cropping on the left would help the eye to see it better.  I like the curve of the guitar against the dark, but I wish the edge on the top right wasn''t cropped.</td>', 'Vibrating string - a good visual reminder of sound.  Cropping on the left would help the eye to see it better.  I like the curve of the guitar against the dark, but I wish the edge on the top right wasn''t cropped.', '2003-06-06 12:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(317727, 23427, 7628, '<td valign="top">These drums seem silent - I wish you could have found a way to show the viewer how they sound, or what they look like when making sound.  Wish it were all in focus, and the lighting were more distinct.</td>', 'These drums seem silent - I wish you could have found a way to show the viewer how they sound, or what they look like when making sound.  Wish it were all in focus, and the lighting were more distinct.', '2003-06-06 12:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(317730, 23517, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the blue and orange of the hightlights that shape the headphones so we can see them against the black.  I like the composition - just wish the crop wasn;t so tight on the top.  Very nice exectution and subject - makes me want to pick them up and hear what music is playing. 8</td>', 'I like the blue and orange of the hightlights that shape the headphones so we can see them against the black.  I like the composition - just wish the crop wasn;t so tight on the top.  Very nice exectution and subject - makes me want to pick them up and hear what music is playing. 8', '2003-06-06 12:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(317733, 23314, 7628, '<td valign="top">NICE idea.  This definitly makes make think sound!    Must have been dificult to do - lighting both the shiny and mat parts of the clock, getting the motion.  I wish the second hand were a little darker/clearer to see.  9</td>', 'NICE idea.  This definitly makes make think sound!    Must have been dificult to do - lighting both the shiny and mat parts of the clock, getting the motion.  I wish the second hand were a little darker/clearer to see.  9', '2003-06-06 12:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(317737, 23476, 7628, '<td valign="top">Hee, hee!  Fun! There is sound all over the place in this picture.  I like the composition with the curve coming over the top - sound surround us and the action that provokes the screams is obvious.  The stucture at the bottom might be distracting, but I feel it provides balance and makes the viewer wonder what curves and loops these poor screamers are going into next.  Wish it could have been sharp or more blurred with motion, but I''m just being <br/>a little picky now.  8</td>', 'Hee, hee!  Fun! There is sound all over the place in this picture.  I like the composition with the curve coming over the top - sound surround us and the action that provokes the screams is obvious.  The stucture at the bottom might be distracting, but I feel it provides balance and makes the viewer wonder what curves and loops these poor screamers are going into next.  Wish it could have been sharp or more blurred with motion, but I''m just being a little picky now.  8', '2003-06-06 12:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(317743, 23165, 7628, '<td valign="top">Intriguing angle on a violin.  makes it look almost like a bridge.  I like the curve coming into the corner bottom right. The reflection is nice too.  DOF might be a little narrow, I''d like to see what it looks like with a bit more in focus.  The central point here is this piece of wood that hold up the strings, but that doesn''t make me feel sound.  Maybe if the strings were really illuminated - would be neat to see them in the reflection too.  Nice photo. but doesn''t fit the challenge so well for me.</td>', 'Intriguing angle on a violin.  makes it look almost like a bridge.  I like the curve coming into the corner bottom right. The reflection is nice too.  DOF might be a little narrow, I''d like to see what it looks like with a bit more in focus.  The central point here is this piece of wood that hold up the strings, but that doesn''t make me feel sound.  Maybe if the strings were really illuminated - would be neat to see them in the reflection too.  Nice photo. but doesn''t fit the challenge so well for me.', '2003-06-06 12:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(317749, 23523, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like this idea and the lighting gives nice definition to the shape  of the string a bit of balloon and the shadow gives a great feeling of the action,  Although the title tells me what has happened - a baloon has popped - what my eyes tell me is a bit of broken balloon is falling to the ground.  I don''t feel the pop.  I know how hard it must be to catch the defining moment of a balloon popping, nevertheless -this doesn''t do it.  Kudos for trying!</td>', 'I like this idea and the lighting gives nice definition to the shape  of the string a bit of balloon and the shadow gives a great feeling of the action,  Although the title tells me what has happened - a baloon has popped - what my eyes tell me is a bit of broken balloon is falling to the ground.  I don''t feel the pop.  I know how hard it must be to catch the defining moment of a balloon popping, nevertheless -this doesn''t do it.  Kudos for trying!', '2003-06-06 12:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(317758, 23528, 7628, '<td valign="top">yikes!  another balloon photo - This one makes me wince at the thought of the impending sound.  But where the other one was too late to make me really feel th sound, this one is too early.  Again, I know it would be SO hard to catch a balloon popping, but this just makes me want to see it.  The color, light and composition and great in this photo!  And the frame even adds to the feeling of the coming explosion....It is VERY nice.  I really shouldn''t complain.  7</td>', 'yikes!  another balloon photo - This one makes me wince at the thought of the impending sound.  But where the other one was too late to make me really feel th sound, this one is too early.  Again, I know it would be SO hard to catch a balloon popping, but this just makes me want to see it.  The color, light and composition and great in this photo!  And the frame even adds to the feeling of the coming explosion....It is VERY nice.  I really shouldn''t complain.  7', '2003-06-06 12:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(317760, 23335, 7628, '<td valign="top">Cool image.  Look at those twirling lights!  I also appreciate how you lit the canister so we could see the source of the "pow"   The lights are so intersting it almost makes you forget the obvious sound.</td>', 'Cool image.  Look at those twirling lights!  I also appreciate how you lit the canister so we could see the source of the "pow"   The lights are so intersting it almost makes you forget the obvious sound.', '2003-06-06 12:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(317807, 23372, 6523, '<td valign="top">I personally might have cropped out some of the bottom (to their waists) and some of the hedge on the right to bring the focus a little more on the children''s upper bodies, but however you crop it, it''s a great photo for "sound."  8</td>', 'I personally might have cropped out some of the bottom (to their waists) and some of the hedge on the right to bring the focus a little more on the children''s upper bodies, but however you crop it, it''s a great photo for "sound."  8', '2003-06-06 14:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
