(317971, 22855, 1041, '<td valign="top">I don''t have time to vote this week, but I just wanted to leave you a quick comment that I really like your photo.  I can definitely see you getting a ribbon.  It meets the challenge, and is technically very well executed.  The high-key photo is nicely balanced by the black rim of the hat.  Composition is unusual and works well.  Congratulations on a wonderful photo :)</td>', 'I don''t have time to vote this week, but I just wanted to leave you a quick comment that I really like your photo.  I can definitely see you getting a ribbon.  It meets the challenge, and is technically very well executed.  The high-key photo is nicely balanced by the black rim of the hat.  Composition is unusual and works well.  Congratulations on a wonderful photo :)', '2003-06-06 18:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
