(319268, 22840, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like the journalistic feel of this photo. I do wish that something were in focus though; I don''t mind motion blur at all, but I do like it to contrast with focused things. still, nice capture and composition.</td>', 'I like the journalistic feel of this photo. I do wish that something were in focus though; I don''t mind motion blur at all, but I do like it to contrast with focused things. still, nice capture and composition.', '2003-06-09 00:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
