(319530, 23472, 7806, '<td valign="top">Just to explain this, i doubt anyone cares as i finished last but, this was taken at a concert in Boston put on by a band named Manitoba.  Right as the band hit their first note, this gentleman looked up from the floor ( i was on the second level ) and started watching the band.  His reaction to "sound" was what I was capturing.  This was only saturated, the camera shook in the darkness to create the blur and the colors were just stage lights.  Can''t believe, well yeah i can at this site, that this photo got rated so low.<br/> <br/>peace</td>', 'Just to explain this, i doubt anyone cares as i finished last but, this was taken at a concert in Boston put on by a band named Manitoba.  Right as the band hit their first note, this gentleman looked up from the floor ( i was on the second level ) and started watching the band.  His reaction to "sound" was what I was capturing.  This was only saturated, the camera shook in the darkness to create the blur and the colors were just stage lights.  Can''t believe, well yeah i can at this site, that this photo got rated so low. peace', '2003-06-09 10:24:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(319550, 23394, 1779, '<td valign="top">Thank you all sooo much for your comments. never before have I recieve such nice ones. <br/> <br/>Thanks to my beautiful models, specially the young one for staying put for more than 5 minutes. I love u guys.<br/> <br/>gracias a todos,<br/> <br/>LM</td>', 'Thank you all sooo much for your comments. never before have I recieve such nice ones.  Thanks to my beautiful models, specially the young one for staying put for more than 5 minutes. I love u guys. gracias a todos, LM', '2003-06-09 11:12:27.000000', NULL, 0),
