(425087, 23537, 9441, '<td valign="top">Fabulous photo...takes me back to my childhood days...oh such fun to be a kid again!  Great shot, I love the motion of the water frozen in mid-air, and the boy''s expression on his face...beautifully done....</td>', 'Fabulous photo...takes me back to my childhood days...oh such fun to be a kid again!  Great shot, I love the motion of the water frozen in mid-air, and the boy''s expression on his face...beautifully done....', '2003-09-21 17:10:05.000000', NULL, 0),
