(497905, 22947, 6999, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by dsidwell:</b></div><hr/><i>I suppose you mean "in a PREVIOUS existence?" No matter. I love the point of view here,and your lighting could not be better. Super work!</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Note for future confused readers of this comment: photo originally titled ''In a pervious existence'' - just a typo - but I found a way to correct it :-) after voting.</td>', 'Originally posted by dsidwell:I suppose you mean "in a PREVIOUS existence?" No matter. I love the point of view here,and your lighting could not be better. Super work!  Note for future confused readers of this comment: photo originally titled ''In a pervious existence'' - just a typo - but I found a way to correct it :-) after voting.', '2003-11-28 22:02:27.000000', NULL, 0),
