(788272, 23530, 12809, '<td valign="top">Really cute shot, Steve.  I like the comp.  I also agree that losing the blue cast would improve this shot.  I might even clone out that light line in the bg, from the seal''s eye to the right edge of the shot.  Nice work, though.</td>', 'Really cute shot, Steve.  I like the comp.  I also agree that losing the blue cast would improve this shot.  I might even clone out that light line in the bg, from the seal''s eye to the right edge of the shot.  Nice work, though.', '2004-06-30 22:13:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(788302, 23530, 18349, '<td valign="top">There''s a tad of a blue cast on my monitor.  I''d like to see more of the sea lion.  I can definitely hear him, though.  Good take on that challenge.  :o)</td>', 'There''s a tad of a blue cast on my monitor.  I''d like to see more of the sea lion.  I can definitely hear him, though.  Good take on that challenge.  :o)', '2004-06-30 22:29:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(788474, 23530, 19474, '<td valign="top">I like the blue hue to this photo, I think it makes the photo standout<br/>I think it would just be another good animal shot if the coloring was left std as the inside of the mouth would distract from the great cropping used here</td>', 'I like the blue hue to this photo, I think it makes the photo standoutI think it would just be another good animal shot if the coloring was left std as the inside of the mouth would distract from the great cropping used here', '2004-07-01 00:18:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(788495, 23530, 14986, '<td valign="top">This guy looks like he''s singing!  I like the composition and the cropping but I would have liked a smoother, less noisy look to the shot.  I don''t think the blue adds anything to it, but I''d have to see it will different options really to tell for sure.<br/> <br/>It sure is a cute shot.</td>', 'This guy looks like he''s singing!  I like the composition and the cropping but I would have liked a smoother, less noisy look to the shot.  I don''t think the blue adds anything to it, but I''d have to see it will different options really to tell for sure. It sure is a cute shot.', '2004-07-01 00:30:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(792728, 23530, 15920, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about the blue either.  That said, the crop and framing are tremendous.  I can almost see him jumping out of the water while barking, and creating a huge "noisy" splash.<br/></td>', 'I''m not sure about the blue either.  That said, the crop and framing are tremendous.  I can almost see him jumping out of the water while barking, and creating a huge "noisy" splash.', '2004-07-02 18:28:03.000000', NULL, 0),
